WcdGmNJkk_nT4hfj9C_z1Po5GiohKcK7daShLwjZsPL0ggyItgd3A4oU1nUJjYX8v21jjghe68kA=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMFR6q1CHkwjkSH9h6Mf4PnDP6ES0afcx54VtCKfve2mlTLFR-ygMgA6YAYEyWjPtpAKKt1uy5KND0CLMWRlUitim90gj3eHz8-_6JyTxijJV-KsuDXSUxCNOI4PwYejXLTJjD5nb10eWOo=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNJ6SCyC0qYIyBiiNo2ldco5Oo-KvvVB027azT4R69KU6w30F41aB3Ds962YKIIm-PY5Ha5aObL_XMuPnEVZrhj3vKUKthwPQd5v4NV8qBylTC1OkyncJpoLH0KZLEHAv_ebRKJlOh0FQTj=k-no""],""When"":""Edited 4 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210MFpESnRUMWR5TnkxNGNHRjNPRjh0ZDNWclUwRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102475735981892890995/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1774955977990364,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1777637506028221,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Contratamos a Casas Casablanca para construir nuestra casa en modalidad “llave en mano” y lamentablemente la experiencia ha sido muy mala, especialmente en la postventa.\nLa vivienda fue entregada con problemas graves desde el inicio, incluyendo una fuga de gas y un problema sanitario que hasta hoy genera malos olores constantes en el baño, haciendo muy incómodo vivir en la casa. Además, hay múltiples fallas en terminaciones, instalaciones deficientes y errores en mobiliario que no fueron corregidos adecuadamente.\nDurante meses hemos informado todos estos problemas, pero las soluciones han sido parciales o inexistentes. Incluso se nos indicó que algunas reparaciones no se realizarían mientras no se pagara un cobro adicional por concepto de cámaras de agua, el cual fue informado con posterioridad al contrato y no de manera previa, lo que resulta inapropiado considerando que se trata de fallas de construcción.\nFuera de todos los detalles, que son más de los que se muestran en las fotos, lo más grave es el olor constante que genera el baño, ya que hace inhabitable vivir en esas condiciones, especialmente considerando que se trata de adultos mayores.\nSe envió una carta formal solicitando solución y plazos de reparación, la cual no fue respondida dentro del plazo indicado. Actualmente el caso se encuentra en proceso mediante SERNAC y asesoría legal.\nNo recomendaría esta empresa, especialmente por su deficiente servicio de postventa."",""text_translated"":""We hired Casas Casablanca to build our house on a \""turnkey\"" basis, and unfortunately, the experience has been very poor, especially the after-sales service.\nThe house was delivered with serious problems from the start, including a gas leak and a plumbing issue that still causes constant bad smells in the bathroom, making it very uncomfortable to live in. In addition, there are multiple finishing defects, faulty installations, and errors in the furnishings that were not properly corrected.\nFor months, we have reported all these problems, but the solutions have been partial or nonexistent. We were even told that some repairs would not be carried out until we paid an additional fee for water chambers, which was communicated after the contract was signed, not beforehand. This is inappropriate considering that these are construction defects.\nAside from all the other issues, which are more numerous than those shown in the photos, the most serious problem is the constant smell coming from the bathroom, as it makes living in these conditions uninhabitable, especially considering that the residents are elderly. A formal letter requesting a solution and repair timeline was sent, but no response was received within the stated timeframe. The case is currently being processed by SERNAC (Chile's National Consumer Service) and legal counsel. I would not recommend this company, especially due to its poor after-sales service."",""published_at"":""2026-03-31T11:19:37.990364Z""},{""Name"":""BENJAMIN ANTONIO OLIVER COSCOLLA"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLi8gafeGpgM2wpW3O632D3i9Ucf48HLt_0sPUPhCDWfw8baQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Muy buena experiencia. Desde el inicio, el equipo fue súper atento y transparente con todo el proceso. Lo que más nos gustó fue la flexibilidad en el diseño de las casas, con opciones para adaptarlas a lo que realmente necesitamos."",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUN3dHZqakZREAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108646871522023071177/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1742323180617648,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1742323180617648,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Muy buena experiencia. Desde el inicio, el equipo fue súper atento y transparente con todo el proceso. Lo que más nos gustó fue la flexibilidad en el diseño de las casas, con opciones para adaptarlas a lo que realmente necesitamos."",""text_translated"":""A very good experience. From the beginning, the team was incredibly attentive and transparent throughout the entire process. What we liked most was the flexibility in the house designs, with options to adapt them to our specific needs."",""published_at"":""2025-03-18T18:39:40.617648Z""},{""Name"":""ignacio ayala paulsen"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEeLoIf9dZ8zY7jFIBUJ0-jGN2RiMsoaqq8CfXT2PDMDqTJg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Fui a su sala de ventas y me atendieron super bien.\nMe entregaron todos los detalles para realizar prontamente mi nuevo proyecto.\n100% Personalizado, amigables y muy profesionales.\nAdemás, trabajan con productos de excelente calidad.\nLos recomiendo a ojos cerrados."",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSZ2VMUUtBEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105157615849776694276/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1682523193980475,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1682523193980475,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Fui a su sala de ventas y me atendieron super bien.\nMe entregaron todos los detalles para realizar prontamente mi nuevo proyecto.\n100% Personalizado, amigables y muy profesionales.\nAdemás, trabajan con productos de excelente calidad.\nLos recomiendo a ojos cerrados."",""text_translated"":""I went to their showroom and they treated me wonderfully.\nThey gave me all the details I needed to get my new project started right away.\n100% personalized, friendly, and very professional.\nPlus, they work with excellent quality products. I recommend them without hesitation."",""published_at"":""2023-04-26T15:33:13.980475Z""},{""Name"":""Francisca Cid Norambuena"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVeuGUfHfC-1HLqwuPvpA1Aw_A-C2J917tFhsCV_XgBIXYMbp1Xew=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Excelente atención! Me orientaron muy bien sobre los materiales y las buenas opciones que tenian para construir la casa."",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUN3MXVDRzN3RRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103899225127586057084/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1742318624539254,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1742318624539254,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Excelente atención! Me orientaron muy bien sobre los materiales y las buenas opciones que tenian para construir la casa."",""text_translated"":""Excellent service! They gave me great guidance on the materials and the good options they had for building the house."",""published_at"":""2025-03-18T17:23:44.539254Z""},{""Name"":""Sebastián Piña"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWORAHgHUhIuhyzShOyIl2YhW7pCTGdxX-1HsRS7PNTATji2yw4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":2,""Description"":""Las casas se ven decentes y la atención en el local fue gentil, pero luego de dos semanas nunca me enviaron las cotizaciones comprometidas en la conversación. Si no tienen dedicación y compromiso al iniciar la venta, da para pensar cómo será después."",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKaDZLSzFnRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":2,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116950323877298774801/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1690151366021159,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1690151366021159,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Las casas se ven decentes y la atención en el local fue gentil, pero luego de dos semanas nunca me enviaron las cotizaciones comprometidas en la conversación. Si no tienen dedicación y compromiso al iniciar la venta, da para pensar cómo será después."",""text_translated"":""The houses look decent and the service at the office was friendly, but after two weeks they still haven't sent me the quotes they promised during our conversation. If they lack dedication and commitment at the start of the sales process, it makes you wonder what they'll be like later on."",""published_at"":""2023-07-23T22:29:26.021159Z""},{""Name"":""Claudio Hernan Garcia Toro"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXr_pSNqltSjsKO58migXPDQET-pFoSICIqJ7Q9XQ6DjfqnArHq2g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""espectacular su carta internacional de cafés con Alcohol además sus tortas únicas, sándwich y chocolate italiano cuchara parada y la heladería artesanal de Bravissimo muy rico todo"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WamFrdDVSME5rWm10bGNuZGxSR1pSVW1OMlVIYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111129427652745483959/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1753922775927207,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1753922775927207,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""espectacular su carta internacional de cafés con Alcohol además sus tortas únicas, sándwich y chocolate italiano cuchara parada y la heladería artesanal de Bravissimo muy rico todo"",""text_translated"":""Their international menu of alcoholic coffees is spectacular, plus their unique cakes, sandwiches, and Italian chocolate are simply divine, and Bravissimo's artisanal ice cream is delicious—everything is wonderful."",""published_at"":""2025-07-31T00:46:15.927207Z""},{""Name"":""Renata Ossa"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUvXS8KqWYNCqGFymnuxcmLwltAxQSekhFlNqIUnGNSrFoEc30=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Exelente calidad de los materiales que usan, la propuesta de obra gruesa habitable es única. Cumplen 100% con lo que prometen, tanto en plazos como en materiales, recomendadisimo."",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNsbzhxZlhREAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100630724716114406972/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1700945053915357,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1700945053915357,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Exelente calidad de los materiales que usan, la propuesta de obra gruesa habitable es única. Cumplen 100% con lo que prometen, tanto en plazos como en materiales, recomendadisimo."",""text_translated"":""Excellent quality materials; their concept of a habitable, structurally sound home is unique. They deliver 100% on their promises, both in terms of deadlines and materials. Highly recommended."",""published_at"":""2023-11-25T20:44:13.915357Z""},{""Name"":""Constanza Daroch B."",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIqlRfmvTSz0c8EoPlnMkKQlL6vs2YPDdsSHesT9PBY7S10NQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rati