d_at_unix_micros"":1758559513435000,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1758559513435000,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Demoraron más de 4 años en construir la cabaña a mi madre … ella creía que la habían estafado. Pero finalmente cumplieron y lograron hacer una cabaña hermosa y de muy buena calidad. No sé si sirva este comentario por si quieren una cabaña de buena calidad (económica) pero sin apuro … les servirá"",""text_translated"":""It took them over four years to build the cabin for my mother… she thought she'd been scammed. But they finally delivered and built a beautiful, high-quality cabin. I don't know if this review will be helpful if you're looking for a good-quality (and affordable) cabin but aren't in a rush… but it might be useful."",""published_at"":""2025-09-22T16:45:13.435Z""},{""Name"":""Deisy Macarena"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWsGzlKlIVlDRYtt8MZyNH7o1DiQxLYR0sGsR27xtT50cl2QxohkQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":"""",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMydnVHcU1REAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113256095942503036874/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1650591957279288,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1650591957279288,""language"":"""",""translated_lang"":"""",""text_original"":"""",""text_translated"":"""",""published_at"":""2022-04-22T01:45:57.279288Z""}]",null,
