""Alexander Munro"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLD2GN17VfC-kPlWTTTEewK2NXUdWDHGt5_W4Eef7oqlCJ9ng=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Construímos nuestra casa en Panguipulli con Casur hace más de 12 años, quedamos muy conformes con el resultado. Gente muy seria y responsable. Totalmente recomendados, pasan los años y esta sigue perfecta."",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvenJ6TjhRRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102793853725229115249/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1745534110892170,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1745534110892170,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Construímos nuestra casa en Panguipulli con Casur hace más de 12 años, quedamos muy conformes con el resultado. Gente muy seria y responsable. Totalmente recomendados, pasan los años y esta sigue perfecta."",""text_translated"":""We built our house in Panguipulli with Casur over 12 years ago, and we were very happy with the result. They are very professional and responsible. We highly recommend them; years have passed and the house is still perfect."",""published_at"":""2025-04-24T22:35:10.89217Z""},{""Name"":""VICTOR HERRERA MARTINEZ"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0Md55qT-10Vo-jEBRpUC53kODG6P1pfes_O0JBbdv1A5zz0pw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Mala experiencia.Casa construida en Florida,Concepcion. Demoraron mas de 2 años en construir. Cambian de materiales a su arbitrio para  reducir costos. En mi caso, dejaron imperfecciones en construccion y el daño mayor, filtraciones en ambos baños lo que aun no hace habitable la vivienda. Cuando se les informa, no responden llamados, correos y no dan la cara. Empresa familiar con poco respaldo y sin servicio de postventa. Si quieres evitar los procesos de denuncia o demanda, EVALUA OTRA OPCION ANTES."",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VLbkM3OEd6aHN6RTVnRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116834702911069482908/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1746628798915831,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1746628798915831,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Mala experiencia.Casa construida en Florida,Concepcion. Demoraron mas de 2 años en construir. Cambian de materiales a su arbitrio para  reducir costos. En mi caso, dejaron imperfecciones en construccion y el daño mayor, filtraciones en ambos baños lo que aun no hace habitable la vivienda. Cuando se les informa, no responden llamados, correos y no dan la cara. Empresa familiar con poco respaldo y sin servicio de postventa. Si quieres evitar los procesos de denuncia o demanda, EVALUA OTRA OPCION ANTES."",""text_translated"":""Bad experience. House built in Florida, Concepción. It took them over two years to build. They change materials at will to cut costs. In my case, they left construction imperfections, and the biggest problem was leaks in both bathrooms, which still make the house uninhabitable. When I informed them, they didn't answer calls or emails and wouldn't even take responsibility. It's a family business with little support and no after-sales service. If you want to avoid the legal process of filing a complaint or lawsuit, CONSIDER ANOTHER OPTION FIRST."",""published_at"":""2025-05-07T14:39:58.915831Z""},{""Name"":""Rosa María Schaff Schaff"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxPXrzvv1gZ-Ym5S18Bluq2yjH08oA6Rq1CIu7ZX8r4ygHwTP0=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Casur me construyó una casa en plena pandemia , anduvimos excelente, agradezco el profesionalismo del equipo de Casur que a pesar de todos los inconvenientes dejaron una casa hermosa y de muy buena calidad , hasta el momento ningún problema"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURva1otcGtBRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103524339460345252494/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1745620018554619,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1745620018554619,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Casur me construyó una casa en plena pandemia , anduvimos excelente, agradezco el profesionalismo del equipo de Casur que a pesar de todos los inconvenientes dejaron una casa hermosa y de muy buena calidad , hasta el momento ningún problema"",""text_translated"":""Casur built me ​​a house right in the middle of the pandemic. Everything went perfectly. I appreciate the professionalism of the Casur team who, despite all the difficulties, left a beautiful and very high-quality house. So far, no problems at all."",""published_at"":""2025-04-25T22:26:58.554619Z""},{""Name"":""Estela Naranjo Bórquez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV86qywzt87PX01oFhUGDLxJvn80LdZUN8_D9Rw4SMuJ2M6ldk=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Pésima atención a sus clientes, los ejecutivos de venta engañan para que firmes y pagues, luego de esto cambian sus versiones. Llevo 6 meses esperando y nada aún de hecho nisiquiera aún hay fecha para comenzar las obras. NO COMPREN ACÁ"",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNXMTgtUV93RRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115128486931513710871/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1646814094053473,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1646814094053473,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Pésima atención a sus clientes, los ejecutivos de venta engañan para que firmes y pagues, luego de esto cambian sus versiones. Llevo 6 meses esperando y nada aún de hecho nisiquiera aún hay fecha para comenzar las obras. NO COMPREN ACÁ"",""text_translated"":""Terrible customer service. The sales executives trick you into signing and paying, then change their story. I've been waiting for six months and still nothing; in fact, there isn't even a start date for the construction. DO NOT BUY HERE."",""published_at"":""2022-03-09T08:21:34.053473Z""},{""Name"":""Karlyng Silva"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWOJyiLiIBAZSCBuutx3mr3EInqCGY3NVsk-SvRvaBOu9Agafb=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Amplio, el homecenter con mayor variedad en el Gran Concepción. Filas largas, pero avanzan rápido."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNxdzUyOElnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107646685447691771234/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1623888900518940,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1623888900518940,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Amplio, el homecenter con mayor variedad en el Gran Concepción. Filas largas, pero avanzan rápido."",""text_translated"":""Spacious, the home center with the largest selection in Greater Concepción. Long lines, but they move quickly."",""published_at"":""2021-06-17T00:15:00.51894Z""},{""Name"":""Gino Nobili"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK9KJi4hcGujnyw-PhsNYL_tTzlEEdW2copSexWJd0b4rEEWw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Buena atención, me han dado respuesta a todas mis consultas y dudas."",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtb1pmekNBEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115825956136930569605/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1643592551844739,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1643592551844739,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"","