 at every stage, always ready to answer my questions. The finishes are superb, and everything was exactly as planned. Highly recommended! The price and quality are excellent compared to other places, and they didn't hesitate to accommodate the distance to my property."",""published_at"":""2024-07-24T02:26:28.191361Z""},{""Name"":""Amaranta Hidalgo"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJS5llrjUAGBq54mMLQM01ZisqIg9r2WaguCmc6kTzgqBUwX40=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Pésima gestión. Excedieron el tiempo de entrega, la casa tiene muchos detalles, incluyendo la mala instalación de cañerías. Los maestros que trabajaron acá son de muy mala calaña (incluyendo el consumo de droga y alcohol en mi propia casa) Finalmente, con todos estos detalles pretenden hacer la entrega en su oficina y no en la casa en cuestión, sin poder corroborar todos los detalles anteriormente descritos. HORRIBLE EXPERIENCIA."",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPeVlYWThnRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104677516745622788915/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1657293871428726,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1657293871428726,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Pésima gestión. Excedieron el tiempo de entrega, la casa tiene muchos detalles, incluyendo la mala instalación de cañerías. Los maestros que trabajaron acá son de muy mala calaña (incluyendo el consumo de droga y alcohol en mi propia casa) Finalmente, con todos estos detalles pretenden hacer la entrega en su oficina y no en la casa en cuestión, sin poder corroborar todos los detalles anteriormente descritos. HORRIBLE EXPERIENCIA."",""text_translated"":""Terrible management. They exceeded the delivery deadline, the house has numerous issues, including faulty plumbing. The workers here are of very poor character (including drug and alcohol use in my own home). Finally, despite all these problems, they intend to deliver the house to their office instead of the actual house, without allowing me to verify any of the issues described above. A HORRIBLE EXPERIENCE."",""published_at"":""2022-07-08T15:24:31.428726Z""},{""Name"":""David Mardones"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJUTGQvEuYIfOyRL_US3dwRqMd_YXqGQOt2LWFjBZFmQxik7Q=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Hace unos 2 años que compré mi casa y ningún detalle, los maestros todos muy caballeros, responsables y muy buena calidad en materiales. Nada que que ver con el comentario negativo."",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNiM01xYnBRRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110160196290830307823/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1721829389928816,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1721829389928816,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Hace unos 2 años que compré mi casa y ningún detalle, los maestros todos muy caballeros, responsables y muy buena calidad en materiales. Nada que que ver con el comentario negativo."",""text_translated"":""I bought my house about two years ago and there haven't been any issues. The builders were all very professional and responsible, and the materials were of very good quality. It's nothing like the negative comment."",""published_at"":""2024-07-24T13:56:29.928816Z""},{""Name"":""marisol del carmen vergara navarrete"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOt913zJwMkptJzHH8iqpYHTQjBpSWX6678FAsg83EKAJ1qOJp=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Quedó muy linda mi casa, lo mejor de todo sus terminaciones y el alero al entrada de la casa. Muy feliz con nuestra compra, la recomiendo."",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyeEtfbVVREAE"",""source"":""