m/maps/contrib/118401331269673406524""}","{""borough"":"""",""street"":""Interior Camino a Coronel 5980"",""city"":""San Pedro de la Paz"",""postal_code"":"""",""state"":""Bio Bio"",""country"":""CL""}",,"[{""id"":""accessibility"",""name"":""Accessibility"",""options"":[{""name"":""Wheelchair-accessible car park"",""enabled"":true},{""name"":""Wheelchair-accessible entrance"",""enabled"":true}]}]","[{""Name"":""Rodolfo Contardo"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKFxyGpKvzJoLU3VCV5hy_bzK96fqXsODYaAHrpxJQX2m_oNw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Compramos 2 tiny house con ellos y la experiencia fue realmente mala. Cerramos el contrato y antes de la entrega nos comentaron que había un error y que debíamos pagar 9 millones de pesos extras. Se demoraron 2 meses más de lo acordado en la entrega, y al recibirla, tuvimos fugas de agua y hay dos puertas que no cierran. Comentamos los problemas y no han sido capaces de responder y hacerse cargo. Una verdadera decepción.  Si pudiera tomar la decisión nuevamente, definitivamente no las compraría. Pésimo servicio."",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1NElXdTJ3RRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112048136030234075140/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1660185242727897,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1660185242727897,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Compramos 2 tiny house con ellos y la experiencia fue realmente mala. Cerramos el contrato y antes de la entrega nos comentaron que había un error y que debíamos pagar 9 millones de pesos extras. Se demoraron 2 meses más de lo acordado en la entrega, y al recibirla, tuvimos fugas de agua y hay dos puertas que no cierran. Comentamos los problemas y no han sido capaces de responder y hacerse cargo. Una verdadera decepción.  Si pudiera tomar la decisión nuevamente, definitivamente no las compraría. Pésimo servicio."",""text_translated"":""We bought two tiny houses from them, and the experience was truly awful. We signed the contract, and before delivery, they told us there had been a mistake and that we had to pay an extra 9 million pesos. Delivery was two months late, and when we finally received them, we had water leaks and two doors that don't close properly. We reported the problems, and they haven't responded or taken responsibility. A real disappointment. If I could make the decision again, I definitely wouldn't buy from them. Terrible service."",""published_at"":""2022-08-11T02:34:02.727897Z""},{""Name"":""Constanza Castillo"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUaW3JaOJXt2u8iWd9lXR8XocLC4MeiUS_NzOWyA1rY85MCwNZB=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""compré una casa y salió súper buena"",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GNlN6Qm9PSE5WZVVsTVVVRnhTRjlzVm14c1VtYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100777936578433482313/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1779220029511823,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1779220029511823,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""compré una casa y salió súper buena"",""text_translated"":""I bought a house and it turned out great"",""published_at"":""2026-05-19T19:47:09.511823Z""},{""Name"":""Tomás del Campo Ariztía"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtUOx81RYHOJjS11ucfhm4WvjXv9E5wGbe0GmaCZBLdEXmde9uaA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Excelente servicio, la Tiny Home que compré quedo espectacular!! Muy agradecido del equipo de Patagual por la experiencia de compra y el cumplimiento de los plazos y términos acordados!!!\n100% recomendado"",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1NE4zY0dBEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104103523940469532230/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1660187618684348,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1660187618684348,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Excelente servicio, la Tiny Home que compré quedo espectacular!! Muy agradecido del equipo de Patagual por la experiencia de compra y el cumplimiento de los plazos y términos acordados!!!\n100% recomendado"",""text_translated"":""Excellent service! The Tiny Home I bought looks amazing!! I'm very grateful to the Patagual team for the shopping experience and for meeting all the agreed-upon deadlines and terms!!!\n100% recommended"",""published_at"":""2022-08-11T03:13:38.684348Z""},{""Name"":""karen schmidt"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI5GZwPbgnYoRDFZZyblzK-axd9L2S4JaKPKoBJX_uqN1_lRw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Las casas son bonitas ,pero no cumplen con lo que prometen,  el agua corre por todo el piso , las puertas no cierran, gotea el lavamanos, y además dan mala información sobre las medidas de las camas,compre todos los colchones y sábanas de la medida que ellos me dieron ,, pero nada me servio, TODO MAL y el gerente comercial se lava las manos,y la post venta  para que decir......peor"",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1NE9YWkNREAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102176438229767637284/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1660185844044462,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1660185844044462,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Las casas son bonitas ,pero no cumplen con lo que prometen,  el agua corre por todo el piso , las puertas no cierran, gotea el lavamanos, y además dan mala información sobre las medidas de las camas,compre todos los colchones y sábanas de la medida que ellos me dieron ,, pero nada me servio, TODO MAL y el gerente comercial se lava las manos,y la post venta  para que decir......peor"",""text_translated"":""The houses are nice, but they don't live up to their promises. Water runs all over the floor, the doors don't close, the sink leaks, and they also give incorrect information about bed sizes. I bought all the mattresses and sheets in the size they gave me, but nothing worked. EVERYTHING IS WRONG, and the sales manager washes his hands of it. And the after-sales service... even worse."",""published_at"":""2022-08-11T02:44:04.044462Z""},{""Name"":""Consuelo Venturelli"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdjAMWF3UJ6sD8lugI1rO5BdtRACJPv6RyMJJwoOwbutaiS2m1=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":"""",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t3M1ltUnJSbEV3ZUc5RVVITnllVXhWYmpCelRtYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104360565403511174247/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1782669036500060,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1782669036500060,""language"":"""",""translated_lang"":"""",""text_original"":"""",""text_translated"":"""",""published_at"":""2026-06-28T17:50:36.50006Z""},{""Name"":""marcos IVAN"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsyLxrvP2PuzffhN_gsf1l6UWO5eob1oRPCDr5wxnMvCOrTNoX=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":"""",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tjNFZsODFZM05CY0d0a09IZEZlbDl6VVRsd2NIYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101719167036918846266/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1779824556137426,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1779824556137426,""language"":"""",""translated_lang"":"""",""text_original"":"""",""text_translated"":"""",""published_at"":""20