ábado (no pude ver casa en remate de 24 mts. Porque  patio, que es donde se encontraba, estába cerrado).\nQuedaron de enviarme fotos y nada a la fecha.\nLa atención fue buena."",""Images"":null,""When"":""Edited 3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtb2I2Y2xBRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":4,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112201417835621369574/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1669918913615594,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1670265162323988,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Fui un día sábado (no pude ver casa en remate de 24 mts. Porque  patio, que es donde se encontraba, estába cerrado).\nQuedaron de enviarme fotos y nada a la fecha.\nLa atención fue buena."",""text_translated"":""I went on a Saturday (I couldn't see the 24 sq m house being auctioned because the patio, where it was located, was closed).\nThey were supposed to send me photos, but I haven't received anything yet.\nThe service was good."",""reply_text"":""Hello Mrs. Brenda, good afternoon. We would like to know why you gave us only 4 stars. We would like to know how we can improve our rating. We hope you have a great afternoon and we look forward to continuing to improve. Sincerely, Valles Del Sur Prefabricated Homes"",""reply_text_original"":""Hola señora Brenda buenas tardes, quisiéramos sabes el por que de su evaluación con solo 4 estrellas, quisiéramos saber como mejorar nuestra calificación.. esperamos tenga una gran tarde y quedamos muy atentos para seguir mejorando \nSaludos cordiales \nValles Del Sur Casas Prefabricadas "",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1669920006000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1669920006000000,""published_at"":""2022-12-01T18:21:53.615594Z""},{""Name"":""Vilma O."",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXOAV4Y6FVYRBnyS2k9BnMKGIP77sLCvQzlkEcFh2uNrKW2qGKhQw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":2,""Description"":""La atención muy buena, pero la entrega deficiente, aunque respondieron por todo e hicieron los cambios correspondientes, pero no fue lo que esperaba."",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCNTlHWDhBRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":2,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104860516447197201797/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1673008660351160,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1673008660351160,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""La atención muy buena, pero la entrega deficiente, aunque respondieron por todo e hicieron los cambios correspondientes, pero no fue lo que esperaba."",""text_translated"":""The service was very good, but the delivery was poor, although they responded to everything and made the corresponding changes, but it wasn't what I expected."",""reply_text"":""Good morning, Ms. Vilma! Could you please tell us how we can improve or provide your contract reference number so we can review your specific case and resolve it if necessary?\nWe are always willing to improve based on the well-intentioned feedback of our clients. Best regards 😉\n\n"",""reply_text_original"":""Señora Vilma buen día! Por favor nos podría indicar como mejorar o su folio de contrato para ver específicamente su caso y resolver si fuese necesario? \nSiempre nosotros estamos dispuestos a mejorar bajo los comentarios bien intencionados de nuestros clientes \nSaludos cordiales 😉 \n"",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1673010522000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1673010522000000,""published_at"":""2023-01-06T12:37:40.35116Z""},{""Name"":""Victor Muñoz"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCNVXbvFxQPE-pqmqPUAMdloj-ZPNR0MEXAzC6loXhNyR74l1SkA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Excelente servicio , la calidad de sus casas esta por sobre su competencia...lo mejor es que son confiables al 100 %... los recomiendo 👌🏼"",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURteXVlbW9RRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109697512036877118091/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1643070052778745,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1643070052778745,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Excelente servicio , la calidad de sus casas esta por sobre su competencia...lo mejor es que son confiables al 100 %... los recomiendo 👌🏼"",""text_translated"":""Excellent service, the quality of their homes is superior to the competition...the best part is that they are 100% reliable...I highly recommend them 👌🏼"",""published_at"":""2022-01-25T00:20:52.778745Z""},{""Name"":""rockpro 70"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJoNYsBpqP3KoWfz6cQjAGoegUEfXMcP5RK0nUYmDiqw0OnLA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Mi nombre es Juan Carlos Bravo y quería comentar que compré una casa de 36 mts2 via redes sociales, con una muy buena atención.\nTodo salió bien."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2NW96YVNnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108979374722507473356/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1630712936250363,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1630712936250363,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Mi nombre es Juan Carlos Bravo y quería comentar que compré una casa de 36 mts2 via redes sociales, con una muy buena atención.\nTodo salió bien."",""text_translated"":""My name is Juan Carlos Bravo, and I wanted to share that I bought a 36-square-meter house through social media, and the service was excellent.\nEverything went well."",""reply_text"":""Thank you so much for your comment! We always strive