maestros a ver el terreno y nunca llegan."",""text_translated"":""I do not recommend Casa Luz Elena:\n- You have to provide them with water, electricity, a bathroom, and allow the construction worker to stay overnight.\n\n- They don't provide receipts or invoices to avoid taxes.\n\n- They take the leftover materials even if you've already paid for them.\n\n- The sales representatives are extremely rude, and each one changes the materials they offer.\n\n- They charge for leveling the land and promise that construction workers will come to inspect it, but they never show up."",""published_at"":""2026-02-11T11:28:41.372287Z""},{""Name"":""lucero santibañez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbcEpwUhaxOY55dJoYJGXoZcFmphVvFwOsAidKYEhBOX7Ssw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Esta cerrado ,no existe"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQNHVQaTNnRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117851665638856635439/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1732975319943646,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1732975319943646,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Esta cerrado ,no existe"",""text_translated"":""It's closed, it doesn't exist"",""published_at"":""2024-11-30T14:01:59.943646Z""},{""Name"":""Patricio Vergara"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJLWnz9Ofi6_2CEI8FPwzL-MD9nL13sH1zBM4AY5Bf8H7DOYA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":"""",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkdEo3bm93RRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107313121128744993379/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1707765948500246,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1707765948500246,""language"":"""",""translated_lang"":"""",""text_original"":"""",""text_