ble, es un gran equipo el que tiene Empresa Arbolitos..."",""text_translated"":""After visiting several other sales points, I must say that the sales executive, Ms. Pamela Torres A., was exceptionally helpful in presenting the product, explaining its technical specifications and quality, responding to inquiries, and providing solutions, clearly outlining what she was offering. I also want to highlight her dedication right up to the delivery of the house on-site. Congratulations! 100% recommended. Arbolitos Company has a fantastic team."",""published_at"":""2020-11-12T00:38:10.855936Z""},{""Name"":""Patricia Sánchez gatica"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLBXYFnb-FLw2YDfzGyoiRENJEJTCAs1Kpsf_lfzDPfZr1NgA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Excelentes casas, la compre en el 2013 en Buin. Y hasta el día de hoy todo perfecto. acogedoras guardan muy bien el calor y en verano fresquitas.\nMuy recomendadas !!!"",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1OXRETC13RRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108221992990291425293/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1658977955204499,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1658977955204499,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Excelentes casas, la compre en el 2013 en Buin. Y hasta el día de hoy todo perfecto. acogedoras guardan muy bien el calor y en verano fresquitas.\nMuy recomendadas !!!"",""text_translated"":""Excellent houses! I bought mine in 2013 in Buin, and to this day, everything is perfect. They're cozy, retain heat very well, and are nice and cool in the summer.\nHighly recommended!"",""published_at"":""2022-07-28T03:12:35.204499Z""},{""Name"":""Claudio Cèsar Verdejo Lòpez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJdrQdSSF5F2Ka8a4fUJiWrsHtob9UPUOvGeJZ20VF3u64a8p2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Pésimo, no fueron capaces de enviarme una cotización, después de haber ido y ver las casas. 0 responsabilidad, no me quiero imaginar cuanto se demoran en construir una casa ni como les queda."",""Images"":null,""When"":""8 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN3X3ZEZVNnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102299109871037795874/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1533249029189000,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1533249200092000,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Pésimo, no fueron capaces de enviarme una cotización, después de haber ido y ver las casas. 0 responsabilidad, no me quiero imaginar cuanto se demoran en construir una casa ni como les queda."",""text_translated"":""Terrible. They couldn't even send me a quote after I went and saw the houses. Zero responsibility. I don't even want to imagine how long it takes them to build a house or what the final result will be like."",""published_at"":""2018-08-02T22:30:29.189Z""},{""Name"":""Gerald Dunnage"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUpGhqqtb_yI9nSKfNvn3OUXBYoLJaogFAU2h5JIbtPmYPFh8Ip=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Muy buena disposicion de la encargada, tienen muy lindos modelos de casa. Vale la pena preguntar y cotizar."",""Images"":null,""When"":""Edited 3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNnX2RhZFpREAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101940570143813344305/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1522002512302000,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1686070701396745,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Muy buena disposicion de la encargada, tienen muy lindos modelos de casa. Vale la pena preguntar y cotizar."",""text_translated"":""The manager was very helpful, and they have some very nice house m