t.com/a/ACg8ocL96deAjh61h7oE80n4ISP-4KOL6yL4t4ZLpt8k0iPyEbKvsA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Muy buenas casas, diferentes modelos, los diseños y materiales son de buena calidad. Para todos bolsillos. Tienen opciones de compras por kis, los cuales los envian por flete el cual cobran. Tambien trabajan con constructoras que se pueden hacer cargo del montaje e instalación completa de las casas o cabañas."",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmM_QEb_2tGRRS2xvDcAAlJySpvE-fnmy3Tkf6_s0dns-Jggv5gRr1WPmz6Xx-adbYso6w7glKCyXKRRsS-EzzGfafwUHlhDZWN8j7js5xACjLc8aDwepMPAA2KEN-BYz6d-9US9ak73Uyxx=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMLbL0uOWq7VovuTlkzhxNTOFNliF7T5O4zguw0AQ-66X9nvtytrqSqzLBNrVK7d_c8kS2HC0ANcvLr2ZQGs2IyePapuw9EPK9m0-vnoo5wxcjknPE_SAYI-RQb49NAfOb0J5MQn11vM-c=k-no""],""When"":""4 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21jMWVFTnhWbnBKTlY5eFptd3diRGt4YVdsUU9XYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110640536315947062250/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1778601325621775,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1778601325621775,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Muy buenas casas, diferentes modelos, los diseños y materiales son de buena calidad. Para todos bolsillos. Tienen opciones de compras por kis, los cuales los envian por flete el cual cobran. Tambien trabajan con constructoras que se pueden hacer cargo del montaje e instalación completa de las casas o cabañas."",""text_translated"":""Very nice houses, different models, the designs and materials are of good quality. Something for every budget. They offer the option to buy in kits, which they ship via freight for an additional fee. They also work with construction companies that can handle the complete assembly and installation of the houses or cabins."",""published_at"":""2026-05-12T15:55:25.621775Z""},{""Name"":""Mario “Ernesthyn”"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKoGp-tkWQEYdug03dyF6Diys3FIi5ML75pYuRKmHyYAsKfL28X=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Cuando estuve en Villarrica fue el lugar de la parada del bus que venía de Temuco"",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4aFIwVnBSR2RYYUZORmVXTlZiR1J0VWxFd1JrRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113957878080150304718/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1781313641177389,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1781313641177389,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Cuando estuve en Villarrica fue el lugar de la parada del bus que venía de Temuco"",""text_translated"":""When I was in Villarrica, it was the location of the bus stop for the bus that came from Temuco."",""published_at"":""2026-06-13T01:20:41.177389Z""},{""Name"":""Monica Gana"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwT-J2nAmHSXt5Z0aEUDZIj6Jb7-LHHq41_Ht1gZEKvCLq-_Zu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Muy atenta la vendedora, nos dio todas las explicaciones con respecto a las casas y tienen modelo de todas las unidades."",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMY0QsEZpnQNuaqDyOaOZVBxPtwPA5tLiDY8WKJkJ_luroIvnEc0LASkasWUJ4AcwPClstk4kEPDs6mNMBbUNxWHlOXfUheh5gdlUc0N_l13E5h15h6KUOeF5Iq7G1oEhHFsIyZ=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmN-AuF3Ip4Rbb8nTR6Ya7DnnhKaDsgTMeHeZNnja2aD1DL9j8CLfe9Y5e1CD5Z0AKOUmmxCQo8x21hBQ4bb8fYZfGsFamKy5gMHDAuDg6Hhy5xyAWjpomMPwPw9Em1z4r-qs68r=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPxavPDwNcQeZW4FsJJNRLL19cSo_TEHC9CiTXFAgUzLG6bG9jAcoLR-GiJAOlMYv71w_uPExRDo-5Oir85oX_-nQl88SbkCyTlp4z-1V8wE5hQ2a5iZx1RLAyBvhIHi2w-JEg=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmN34hMOFTTa_btbeTVr1ICIeKesiigc7HFR--o2t3C0Fj9rg27bhomNJUdvcxNptX-1mH5B5sXLn4pMBQiTrakyFPJcbZMJY7coeuqA7GO2s-QLBr1xRIJU1RhqHlh72HPFFfQbPA=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmO0LcckYGEKzjzGQFKKriIRX2GKG7ZewPzdku7UC_NYRPUJHzwm9hVQe1gXx6zPl92EbW4_Rklho5XUc2Bm55-3rQjapHzzt1h9htJPNLoi3wyfF4334-Rh1aBTf1i8_GmMT8A=k-no""],""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKMmZxeHNRRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102185076681986630741/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1689822362808641,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1689822362808641,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Muy atenta la vendedora, nos dio todas las explicaciones con respecto a las casas y tienen modelo de todas las unidades."",""text_translated"":""The saleswoman was very attentive, she gave us all the explanations regarding the houses and they have models of all the units."",""published_at"":""2023-07-20T03:06:02.808641Z""},{""Name"":""Ivonne Salamanca Catrileo"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWIPYWA2mzJRk2dZDzIAr24iGR57ua0gNPpKLP1iPSz5Rcsxq0GRw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Es al frente de las casas Arbolito en realidad.\nLas mejores tortillas de rescoldo, quesos y mantequilla de campo.\nMientras la mamá compra, el juega con el gatito 😻!!!!"",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmM3WRYplXgj6oisN1pu_RbgquXDatbMQLFjxoPQtqdzbu46gqKmRCi2YFU9PEu5wuJWm8K3NYTzS6jLgTN8ZqycQQ3j_xs4aZLCRTHbLhtE-3exO9zUU3CIQTzV0JdixcJYHKmoGbUDCcPh=k-no""],""When"":""7 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214eFRWRkVkRmhuTVRndFFUZFNOazVPT0Y5d2JIYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115901012116769086583/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1770431295633250,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1770431369455178,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Es al frente de las casas Arbolito en realidad.\nLas mejores tortillas de rescoldo, quesos y mantequilla de campo.\nMientras la mamá compra, el juega con el gatito 😻!!!!"",""text_translated"":""It's right in front of the Arbolito houses, actually.\nThe best tortillas cooked in embers, cheeses, and farm butter.\nWhile Mom shops, he plays with the kitten 😻!!!!"",""published_at"":""2026-02-07T02:28:15.63325Z""},{""Name"":""Carlos Duke"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5j4myNegXQTg3hLEhHZY9a-8mM_hSsISfNmyp8ExQoT4OaWI5=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":4,""Description"":""Muy agradable lugar, buena atención y buenos precios ."",""Images"":null,""When"":""9 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkTVJrTjFaMDVEVDNSdU0zSkhTbG80Wm1wUlVIYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":4,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108423963130648056889/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1764286936884384,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1764286936884384,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Muy agradable lugar, buena atención y buenos precios ."",""text_translated"":""Very nice place, good service and good prices."",""published_at"":""2025-11-27T23:42:16.884384Z""},{""Name"":""constanza palma"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDm9Ku-g2rFnlsCtVqHuZ50KaL0N3nTQhYbpq-aZ3cLKrUIKQ8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Es una fábrica de casas de excelente calidad que tiene muchos años en el mercado y cada día van introduciendo mayor tecnología y diseño.\nSus valores son accesibles  para todo tipo de bolsillo.\nTienen sala de ventas en Paine, Lautaro y Villarrica\nLas recomiendo"",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSdWJ2U2V3EAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115103728179348909381/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1680738745538684,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1680738745538684,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Es una fábrica de casas de excelente calidad que tiene muchos años en el mercado y cada día van introduciendo mayor tecnología y diseño.\nSus valores son accesibles  para todo tipo de bolsillo.\nTienen sala de ventas en Paine, Lautaro y Villarrica\nLas recomiendo"",""text_translated"":""It's a factory that builds excellent quality homes and has been in the market for many years, constantly introducing new technology and designs.\nTheir prices are affordable for all budgets. They have sales offices in Paine, Lautaro, and Villarrica. I highly recommend them."",""published_at"":""2023-04-05T23:52:25.538684Z""},{""Name"":""Evelyn Castillo"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxeIitHFsjjlYEUCs4wXx_6DNd0oxe2RsNCwFxNN5svWzeHdos=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Bonito y todo pero pésimo servicio. No hay casa llave en mano. Casas sin terminaciones. Ni vidrio vitral.\nNulo el servicio del inspector de obra.\nLo Único bueno son los maestros que tienen, externos a la empresa.\nNo hay una coherencia entre las casas y el valor tan alto."",""Images"":null,""When"":""6 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDNGZUX2NBEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107682895979359506003/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1598390319087201,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1598391517201399,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Bonito y todo pero pésimo servicio. No hay casa llave en mano. Casas sin terminaciones. Ni vidrio vitral.\nNulo el servicio del inspector de obra.\nLo Único bueno son los maestros que tienen, externos a la empresa.\nNo hay una coherencia entre las casas y el valor tan alto."",""text_translated"":""Nice and all, but terrible service. No turnkey homes. Houses are unfinished. Not even stained glass. The site inspector's service is nonexistent. The only good thing is the independent contractors they employ. There's no consistency between the houses and their high price."",""published_at"":""2020-08-25T21:18:39.087201Z""},{""Name"":""Marcelo Santos"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWe5zrm0UydDgpMMr-2oCBFTC6yjcG0CvCuRY7G3Gmm5Wm0FHmc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""En la sección outlet, los precios son módicos y calidades acordes a los precios. El despacho es económico hasta 20 km a la redonda. Hay variedad de productos en madera y para la construcción.\nPago con transferencia-e, tarjetas de crédito y débito.\nLa sección de venta de casas la desconozco."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURxbTdTVkxnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116427187506297896603/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1626401800929532,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1626402188268764,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""En la sección outlet, los precios son módicos y calidades acordes a los precios. El despacho es económico hasta 20 km a la redonda. Hay variedad de productos en madera y para la construcción.\nPago con transferencia-e, tarjetas de crédito y débito.\nLa sección de venta de casas la desconozco."",""text_translated"":""In the outlet section, prices are reasonable and the quality is commensurate with the prices. Delivery is inexpensive within a 20 km radius. There is a variety of wood and construction products. Payment is accepted via bank transfer, credit card, and debit card. I am unfamiliar with the house sales section."",""published_at"":""2021-07-16T02:16:40.929532Z""}]",null,
