desde la población al centro son max 30-40 minutos de demora. Hay parques, ciclovía, negocios y un mercado."",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSXy1uSmpnRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110231259386648541113/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1683482335119783,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1683482335119783,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Lo mejor es la locomoción, existen micros cada 10-15 minutos, desde la población al centro son max 30-40 minutos de demora. Hay parques, ciclovía, negocios y un mercado."",""text_translated"":""The best thing about it is public transportation; buses run every 10-15 minutes, and the trip from the town to the city center takes a maximum of 30-40 minutes. There are parks, a bike path, shops, and a market."",""published_at"":""2023-05-07T17:58:55.119783Z""},{""Name"":""Daniela Márquez Haro"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVohp2chH9Q-YLdpB2nbk34KKuS-4vrbau7HjDDUaV6RaF2wbtM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Villa portal del sur Panitao, hay mercado con ventas de verduras, mariscos, pescados, bazar, ferretería, carnicería, congelados, local de confiterías, etc. Cerca de comisaria de trapen."",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtOHNucFlBEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111287576125366813351/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1640305806524524,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1640305806524524,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Villa portal del sur Panitao, hay mercado con ventas de verduras, mariscos, pescados, bazar, ferretería, carnicería, congelados, local de confiterías, etc. Cerca de comisaria de trapen."",""text_translated"":""Villa Portal del Sur