,""Rating"":1,""Description"":""No recomiendo contratar con esta empresa. Ofrecen servicios de armado, pero exigen el pago total por adelantado y no cumplen con lo pactado. Tanto el maestro como la ejecutiva se comportaron de forma poco profesional y con falta de respeto.\n\nDurante semanas dejaron el trabajo inconcluso, sin presentarse ni comunicarse con el cliente. El maestro nunca cumple una jornada completa: va solo por unas horas, de forma esporádica, sin avisar el horario, y constantemente encuentra excusas para no trabajar.\n\nDespués de semanas sin avances ni comunicación por parte del maestro o la ejecutiva, finalmente se pusieron en contacto conmigo. Llamaron en horario laboral, con una actitud exigente, como si el problema fuera que yo no quisiera pagar, cuando en realidad estaba ocupado trabajando y les tranferí la totalidad. A pesar de eso, dejaron la casa sin terminar.\nUna experiencia realmente pésima. No los recomendaría."",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMuf07KOStvHkpVpkcC0jGZeDd_TISqjOdfYZf6HCXOvVmINJamLK0T95-qlrSaZbF53NRoOTPzVOmBoavI4Y9lHBjqgVKTfUEN4UcCZaKWp5HjivrgG4bIQzwFjgtVHl7l7ehvUXGF8akg=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNeeAJbsph2BtkemXf53VFDYj8drHEhT0sJQju2BhSLugdjbi1U6GvwZjmVPwhStm0xez3de9-dqjWbHP-l5tDk0OzOQG4sP_29OJNgIgAGeRgA_9x1YYnYFajf-o6LEoh0OAQrHr9nKxk=k-no""],""When"":""11 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOaFNscDNRMjlGZVZCSUxXWlRNMXBzU1dkV2EzYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101635755646868117911/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1758655477976586,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1758655477976586,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""No recomiendo contratar con esta empresa. Ofrecen servicios de armado, pero exigen el pago total por adelantado y no cumplen con lo pactado. Tanto el maestro como la ejecutiva se comportaron de forma poco profesional y con falta de respeto.\n\nDurante semanas dejaron el trabajo inconcluso, sin presentarse ni comunicarse con el cliente. El maestro nunca cumple una jornada completa: va solo por unas horas, de forma esporádica, sin avisar el horario, y constantemente encuentra excusas para no trabajar.\n\nDespués de semanas sin avances ni comunicación por parte del maestro o la ejecutiva, finalmente se pusieron en contacto conmigo. Llamaron en horario laboral, con una actitud exigente, como si el problema fuera que yo no quisiera pagar, cuando en realidad estaba ocupado trabajando y les tranferí la totalidad. A pesar de eso, dejaron la casa sin terminar.\nUna experiencia realmente pésima. No los recomendaría."",""text_translated"":""I do not recommend hiring this company. They offer assembly services, but demand full payment upfront and do not honor their agreements. Both the installer and the sales representative behaved unprofessionally and disrespectfully.\n\nFor weeks they left the job unfinished, without showing up or communicating with the client. The installer never works a full day: he only comes for a few hours, sporadically, without prior notice, and constantly finds excuses not to work.\n\nAfter weeks without progress or communication from either the installer or the sales representative, they finally contacted me. They called during business hours, with a demanding attitude, as if the problem was that I didn't want to pay, when in reality I was busy working and transferred the full amount. Despite this, they left the house unfinished.\nA truly terrible experience. I would not recommend them."",""published_at"":""2025-09-23T19:24:37.976586Z""},{""Name"":""Bryan Chavez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJceeEemirEl9l7oFoNvcMv1JZy4nk-Zq2kWpyYidE27dS4Lw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Poca seriedad. Coordinamos hora de visita para comprar casa y no te llaman nunca y no te responden WhatsApp, no lo recomiendo, poca seriedad 👎🏽"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNnMmVDdFlREAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116451850998138972887/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1739916935637001,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1739916935637001,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Poca seriedad. Coordinamos hora de visita para comprar casa y no te llaman nunca y no te responden WhatsApp, no lo recomiendo, poca seriedad 👎🏽"",""text_translated"":""Very unprofessional. We scheduled a visit to buy a house, but they never called back and didn't answer WhatsApp messages. I don't recommend them, very unprofessional. 👎🏽"",""published_at"":""2025-02-18T22:15:35.637001Z""},{""Name"":""Zu Ka"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6-YwCM-HokouqInr0DezuoPxxm2hCZLJCXfBVAcpj9-SzURKUng=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Pésima experiencia.\nMal los tiempos y mala la casa."",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQbWh1TmlGZzV1QXdRRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110252894575253337631/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1747508464467234,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1747508464467234,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Pésima experiencia.\nMal los tiempos y mala la casa."",""text_translated"":""Terrible experience. The timing was bad and the house was awful."",""published_at"":""2025-05-17T19:01:04.467234Z""},{""Name"":""Arelys Camacho"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK0R9BLbYuUPT0emYfRZ02FMC30qyzbI-a0z5IFWikPAreESw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":"""",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURBenZmU0FnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,"