at_unix_micros"":1647455984669539,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""SI BUSCA CASAS PREFABRICADAS, MAGISUR NO VENDE CASAS PREFABRICADAS ES UN ERROR DE GOOGLE, TAMPOCO SE HACEN PROYECTOS DISTINTOS A LOS MODELOS QUE APARECEN EN LA PAGINA WEB PERO SE PUEDEN EVALUAR ALGUNAS MODIFICACIONES DE ESTOS MISMOS,Y DEBEN LLAMAR A LOS NUMEROS PARA AGENDAR VISITA A LA CASA PILOTO UBICADA EN PADRE LAS CASAS."",""text_translated"":""IF YOU ARE LOOKING FOR PREFABRICATED HOUSES, MAGISUR DOES NOT SELL PREFABRICATED HOUSES. IT IS A GOOGLE ERROR. WE ALSO DO NOT CREATE PROJECTS OTHER THAN THE MODELS THAT APPEAR ON THE WEBSITE, BUT WE CAN EVALUATE SOME MODIFICATIONS TO THESE MODELS. YOU MUST CALL THE NUMBERS PROVIDED TO SCHEDULE A VISIT TO THE SHOW HOUSE LOCATED IN PADRE LAS CASAS."",""published_at"":""2022-03-16T18:38:30.496715Z""},{""Name"":""antonio martins"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXrtlXsBPNAuyApqixQUgwMAlOf4PAFhoXpbjRi9V5Bfzk7xq8=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":4,""Description"":""hola quisiera saber el precio de la casa de 108 m2 que figura en el catalogo, para construir en puerto varas ,dado que les mande varios mail  y no me contestaron , no se si los mande mal , o no los abrieron, desde ya muchas gracias y espero su respuesta a la brevedad , tengo que tomar una decision"",""Images"":null,""When"":""10 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN3dXNINWRnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":4,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110773108302754998534/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1457761089461000,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1457761116839000,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""hola quisiera saber el precio de la casa de 108 m2 que figura en el catalogo, para construir en puerto varas ,dado que les mande varios mail  y no me contestaron , no se si los mande mal , o no los abrieron, desde ya muchas gracias y espero su respuesta a la brevedad , tengo que tomar una decision"",""text_translated"":""Hello, I would like to know the price of the 108 m2 house listed in the catalog, to be built in Puerto Varas. I've sent several emails and haven't received a response. I'm not sure if I sent them incorrectly or if they weren't opened. Thank you in advance, and I look forward to your reply as soon as possible. I need to make a decision."",""published_at"":""2016-03-12T05:38:09.461Z""},{""Name"":""corina muñoz"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQgeA6pgMkzkl0H3QeW6EpoaHgt0mbVJKxzLJS_gxuWoIFng=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":3,""Description"":""Aun no actualiza la página de Facebook, por lo tanto mi viaje fue en vano,solamente ealizan,proyectos"",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2eElYM2ZBEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":3,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105553068229926251577/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1630361663127619,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1630362059388533,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Aun no actualiza la página de Facebook, por lo tanto mi viaje fue en vano,solamente ealizan,proyectos"",""text_translated"":""They haven't updated their Facebook page yet, so my trip was in vain; they only carry out projects."",""published_at"":""2021-08-30T22:14:23.127619Z""},{""Name"":""Héctor García T"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYy3CoqP_t8iN9yaWg1AzQdOMD1-ElZZvc7ciZ9LOTkikQk4i8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":4,""Description"":""Buenas instalaciones y nos atendieron muy bien"",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCN3NYMVdBEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":4,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106551413472378190281/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1674180957238492,""updated_at