,""Description"":""La verdad llevo un año buscando referencias de casas, y llegue a camino real, y creo que es mi mejor opción de construcción."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpNFlieExREAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107628726564644465622/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1604586832842449,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1604586972103773,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""La verdad llevo un año buscando referencias de casas, y llegue a camino real, y creo que es mi mejor opción de construcción."",""text_translated"":""I've been looking for house references for a year now, and I came across Camino Real, and I think it's my best construction option."",""published_at"":""2020-11-05T14:33:52.842449Z""}]",null,
