0"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Quedé muy contento con mi experiencia. Desde el primer contacto fueron muy amables y pacientes para responder todas mis dudas. Me mostraron varios modelos y me ayudaron a elegir el que mejor se ajustaba a mi presupuesto y necesidades. El proceso fue rápido, cumplieron con los plazos y el armado quedó impecable. La casa quedó tal cual la imaginé, con muy buenos acabados y materiales de calidad. Muy Recomendable"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aTk5HRTFXVFJhVkdaUGFEZFBaamxmTVMxUlFrRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109356918077127596958/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1754716357023472,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1754716357023472,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Quedé muy contento con mi experiencia. Desde el primer contacto fueron muy amables y pacientes para responder todas mis dudas. Me mostraron varios modelos y me ayudaron a elegir el que mejor se ajustaba a mi presupuesto y necesidades. El proceso fue rápido, cumplieron con los plazos y el armado quedó impecable. La casa quedó tal cual la imaginé, con muy buenos acabados y materiales de calidad. Muy Recomendable"",""text_translated"":""I was very happy with my experience. From the first contact, they were very kind and patient in answering all my questions. They showed me several models and helped me choose the one that best suited my budget and needs. The process was quick, they met the deadlines, and the assembly was flawless. The house turned out exactly as I imagined it, with excellent finishes and quality materials. Highly recommended."",""published_at"":""2025-08-09T05:12:37.023472Z""},{""Name"":""katherine mella perez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX4BEBgkh7lLlv824yZ9ELphHV5UVL4a2JupR6vjzMnBcXExh8=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Super buena decición comprar aca ya que desde el principio todo super claro, los plazos fijados se respetarón y la calidad de la casa no tiene comparación bien terminada, pensada en un hogar para siempre con mi familia felices, gracias a casas foresco..."",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPnMZWwhUYhr_pSgOR0mkuaLJULVLEhj63ULf7FsrHvC66Ra-8lDmH_oxlZVYNPwXo2scS9YQ8hti1Qnvz5L2xZLswCaPiUIxrkYloqe7PxceNoclHb-fSs6tM4BkVTtLqzK88YTDu1eMRj=k-no""],""When"":""10 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1VWNTMXVVVkZNVW14UVJFNUxlVUp4TURoVFNFRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112198043419202904029/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1762546765744784,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1762546765744784,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Super buena decición comprar aca ya que desde el principio todo super claro, los plazos fijados se respetarón y la calidad de la casa no tiene comparación bien terminada, pensada en un hogar para siempre con mi familia felices, gracias a casas foresco..."",""text_translated"":""Buying here was a fantastic decision! Everything was crystal clear from the start, the deadlines were met, and the quality of the house is unparalleled—it's beautifully finished and designed to be a forever home for my happy family. Thanks to Casas Foresco!"",""published_at"":""2025-11-07T20:19:25.744784Z""},{""Name"":""Emilio Aguilar"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXPkJLymcIA6BM39dP_V1yuyJFVhJUqFc9kp5vCyLA14OSoQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Estoy feliz con mi casa prefabricada. Llegó rápido, todo quedó tal como lo imaginé y la calidad es excelente. El trato fue amable y siempre estuvieron pendientes de cada detalle"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKZlZGbzBhRUZaV2xBeE9YUkNSMlZTTm5KZlRFRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110678438591188301935/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1754716782061452,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1754716782061452,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Estoy feliz con mi casa prefabricada. Llegó rápido, todo quedó tal como lo imaginé y la calidad es excelente. El trato fue amable y siempre estuvieron pendientes de cada detalle"",""text_translated"":""I'm thrilled with my prefabricated home. It arrived quickly, everything turned out exactly as I imagined, and the quality is excellent. The service was friendly, and they were always attentive to every detail."",""published_at"":""2025-08-09T05:19:42.061452Z""},{""Name"":""Rodriguez Rodriguez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLhxLbzJKZWBDcaWBuPfZjuXvEqDQHrwg-Lkl4kN1TtLqY7jQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Estamos comprando una cabaña en este lugar y son muy amigables y empáticos para atender .y de verdad tienen mucha paciencia para atender sobre todos a las personas nuevas que no saben del tema."",""Images"":null,""When"":""8 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaUVVWQnhOVWhzT0RGRmEzZFlUbmRaZVMwMmQyYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101402071233067115362/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1767711785206771,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1767711785206771,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Estamos comprando una cabaña en este lugar y son muy amigables y empáticos para atender .y de verdad tienen mucha paciencia para atender sobre todos a las personas nuevas que no saben del tema."",""text_translated"":""We are buying a cabin here and they are very friendly and empathetic. They really have a lot of patience, especially with new people who don't know much about the area."",""published_at"":""2026-01-06T15:03:05.206771Z""},{""Name"":""Pablo Cruz"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVfOjvfyp8alCFq84Ji-lOExOolqiDQ7IF0k5MeQ89Hvw48O84z=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Muy mala experiencia ,al realizar la compra el camion ya estaba cargado sin poder revisar paneles que al final se encontraban muy chuecos al igual que tablas ,al momento de descargar nos encontramos con tablas chuecas y malas y mucho descuadre y a pesar que la casa se armo apenas la trajimos  ,lo malo que su contrato estipula que mientras el camion salga de la empresa uno no tiene derecho a reclamo ,al final invertimos en madera realmente derecha ,espero que a nadie mas le suceda y que los sueños de tener la casa propia los apoque gente de este tipo 👍"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURBeGYteFRREAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110511712887662227667/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1739195478476151,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1739195478476151,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Muy mala experiencia ,al realizar la compra el camion ya estaba cargado sin poder revisar paneles que al final se encontraban muy chuecos al igual que tablas ,al momento de descargar nos encontramos con tablas chuecas y malas y mucho descuadre y a pesar que la casa se armo apenas la trajimos  ,lo malo que su contrato estipula que mientras el camion salga de la empresa uno no tiene derecho a reclamo ,al final invertimos en madera realmente derecha ,espero que a nadie mas le suceda y que los sueños de tener la casa propia los apoque gente de este tipo 👍"",""text_translated"":""Very bad experience. When we made the purchase, the truck was already loaded, and we couldn't inspect the panels, which turned out to be very crooked, as were some of the boards. Upon unloading, we found crooked and defective boards and a lot of misalignment. Even though the house was assembled as soon as we brought it home, the worst part is that their contract stipulates that you have no right to make a claim once the truck leaves the company. In the end, we invested in perfectly straight wood. I hope this doesn't happen to anyone else and that people like this don't crush the dreams of owning their own home. 👍"",""reply_text"":""Dear Pablo,\n\nWe have reviewed our records and found no purchase under your name. However, at Foresco, we are always open to finding solutions and, if necessary, exchanging materials.\n\nWe have tried to contact you several times to discuss your case, but have not received a response. We invite you to contact us directly or visit our offices so we can review the situation and provide a suitable solution.\n\nOur commitment is to provide quality products and responsible service. We look forward to hearing from you."",""reply_text_original"":""Estimado Pablo,\n\nHemos revisado nuestros registros y no encontramos ninguna compra a su nombre. No obstante, en Foresco siempre estamos abiertos a encontrar soluciones y, en caso de ser necesario, realizar el cambio de materiales.\n\nHemos intentado comunicarnos con usted en varias ocasiones para abordar su caso, pero no hemos recibido respuesta. Le invitamos a contactarnos directamente o acercarse a nuestras oficinas para revisar la situación y darle una solución adecuada.\n\nNuestro compromiso es brindar productos de calidad y un servicio responsable. Quedamos atentos a su comunicación."",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1739201035000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1739201035000000,""published_at"":""2025-02-10T13:51:18.476151Z""},{""Name"":""katerin carreño rojas"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJAxXidjBFADz8wsmiRowEqKQCD3gQxTm1fyzuzP-aAmhoXz74sw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Excelente atención"",""Images"":[""htt