":""Constructora Independencia (Owner)"",""link"":""""}","{""borough"":"""",""street"":""4 1/2 Nte. 3447"",""city"":""Talca"",""postal_code"":"""",""state"":""Maule"",""country"":""CL""}",,"[{""id"":""accessibility"",""name"":""Accessibility"",""options"":[{""name"":""Wheelchair-accessible car park"",""enabled"":true},{""name"":""Wheelchair-accessible entrance"",""enabled"":true}]}]","[{""Name"":""Jaime Aravena Luna"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJzFmLi8haHfJ-gwwgJaout7yhxCKebLYUv7B6GSonAbbk3AgY=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Una empresa mala en todo sentido. La calidad de las construcciones es pésima, las terminaciones, horribles. Los trabajadores, no tienen respeto por la comunidad, conducen a altas velocidades transportando tierra, piedras y otros elementos, los que se desprenden en muchas ocasiones de los camiones. Estacionan sus vehículos en cualquier lugar, incluso donde hay letreros de no estacionar. Dejan basura fuera de las casas, consumen alcohol, comida y todo queda ahí."",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNGb1l2ZHNBRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116395644528246015865/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1698503561530956,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1698503561530956,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Una empresa mala en todo sentido. La calidad de las construcciones es pésima, las terminaciones, horribles. Los trabajadores, no tienen respeto por la comunidad, conducen a altas velocidades transportando tierra, piedras y otros elementos, los que se desprenden en muchas ocasiones de los camiones. Estacionan sus vehículos en cualquier lugar, incluso donde hay letreros de no estacionar. Dejan basura fuera de las casas, consumen alcohol, comida y todo queda ahí."",""text_translated"":""This company is terrible in every way. The construction quality is awful, the finishes are horrendous. The workers have no respect for the community; they drive at high speeds transporting dirt, rocks, and other materials, which often fall off the trucks. They park their vehicles anywhere, even where there are no parking signs. They leave trash outside the houses, consume alcohol and food, and leave it all behind."",""published_at"":""2023-10-28T14:32:41.530956Z""},{""Name"":""maria vergara"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVHczcCvfMKP8F91k_-EJ-GElzH-YK8FunoEfYy-OnKiXWOwfiM3A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":4,""Description"":""Muy buena atencion.. al comprar una vivienda llevar muy claro cuanto cuesta en Uf .y las preguntas .\nlas repuesta de las señorita que atiende son clara.\nOjalá Dios quiera que entreguen la casa cuando nos dijeron que sera fin del 2019 ....."",""Images"":null,""When"":""7 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURZMkpYWTVBRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":4,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108346578445684565936/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1556482701695534,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1556482701695534,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Muy buena atencion.. al comprar una vivienda llevar muy claro cuanto cuesta en Uf .y las preguntas .\nlas repuesta de las señorita que atiende son clara.\nOjalá Dios quiera que entreguen la casa cuando nos dijeron que sera fin del 2019 ....."",""text_translated"":""Excellent service. When buying a house, be very clear about the price in UF (Unidades de Fomento, a Chilean unit of account) and ask any questions you may have. The answers from the young woman who assists you are clear. God willing, they will deliver the house when they told us it would be at the end of 2019..."",""published_at"":""2019-04-28T20:18:21.695534Z""},{""Name"":""Cristian Baeza"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXmgN6lovLnmx9zQW-1We2_atCGbridGAW4HqtPGYsJAn8vJ6HVRw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Todo bien maquillado y estucados, pero en el fondo como el ajo.... uno no sabe si los maestros de roban los materiales(falta fiscalización interna) o derechamente la constructora se los ahorra(sinvergüenzas). Con un destornillador perforas una cadena o pilar."",""Images"":null,""When"":""7 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNZOFBlQmFnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118219450856927132944/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1553982891377465,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1553982891377465,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Todo bien maquillado y estucados, pero en el fondo como el ajo.... uno no sabe si los maestros de roban los materiales(falta fiscalización interna) o derechamente la constructora se los ahorra(sinvergüenzas). Con un destornillador perforas una cadena o pilar."",""text_translated"":""Everything looks nice and plastered, but deep down it's like garlic... you can't tell if the workers are stealing the materials (lack of internal oversight) or if the construction company is simply skimping on them (shameless). You can pierce a chain or pillar with a screwdriver."",""published_at"":""2019-03-30T21:54:51.377465Z""},{""Name"":""Yesica Figueroa Rojas"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHNneDPz2Hf02K15Bi1rZQxdzRMV-0Lwx4Jlo2_wxYBLeVRoTwhQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Mala experiencia con pos y pre venta muchas fallas en la casa, se demoran mucho en dar solucion parche y a demás un par de meses y aparecen las mismas fallas. Es una verguensa la calidad de las casas...."",""Images"":null,""When"":""9 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNRd2VfWWN3EAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111009547258890859005/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1489621309079000,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1489621309079000,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Mala experiencia con pos y pre venta muchas fallas en la casa, se demoran mucho en dar solucion parche y a demás un par de meses y aparecen las mismas fallas. Es una verguensa la calidad de las casas...."",""text_translated"":""Bad experience with both pre- and post-sales service. Many problems with the house; they take a long time to provide a temporary fix, and then the same problems reappear a couple of months later. The quality of these houses is shameful."",""published_at"":""2017-03-15T23:41:49.079Z""},{""Name"":""fabiantecniko"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxlmhm_JnvnrKskE5-pz0oVBFkwsS6PgbL2MaRNw1ZdLRJl9VmsA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":3,""Description"":""Buenísima la atención...pero mala ejecucion de sus viviendas"",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKeU5qeWp3RRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":3,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104599348417042889282/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1687199361110718,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1687199361110718,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Buenísima la atención...pero mala ejecucion de sus viviendas"",""text_translated"":""The service was excellent...but the construction of their homes was poor."",""published_at"":""2023-06-19T18:29:21.110718Z""},{""Name"":""Lorena Robles"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKVJ_9lp7tuBLjPnmdQelYbBCGU0sb3BHHYnUrGtanGVfJ5ng=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Mala pre y post venta... Ningún reclamo se consolida. Servicio Asqueroso"",""Images"":null,""When"":""12 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN3eF9uaklnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""ra