lated"":""It's located on the service road a little past the south entrance of Curicó, on the west side. On holidays they don't have salespeople showing the 3 prefabricated houses they have, but they do have various sizes available. It's a simple but good place."",""published_at"":""2021-12-09T11:38:19.55143Z""},{""Name"":""catalina reyes peña"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWt5IWtb6aD3-qoHpHVvqEdlMHuE3uZHAf9e-fXEIZrsDgHnPVFhA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Demasiado satisfecha con la atención que recibí, las casas son de una excelente calidad, muy limpias, además de que son muy puntuales y no se atrasan con el pedido, se ve que las maderas que utilizan en sus construcciones son de un material resistente, súper satisfecha con la empresa."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpdmZQYWFnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110199278291445293776/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1605211066822501,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1605211066822501,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Demasiado satisfecha con la atención que recibí, las casas son de una excelente calidad, muy limpias, además de que son muy puntuales y no se atrasan con el pedido, se ve que las maderas que utilizan en sus construcciones son de un material resistente, súper satisfecha con la empresa."",""text_translated"":""Extremely satisfied with the service I received, the houses are of excellent quality, very clean, and they are very punctual and never late with the order. It's clear that the wood they use in their constructions is a resistant material. I am extremely satisfied with the company."",""published_at"":""2020-11-12T19:57:46.822501Z""},{""Name"":""Yovana Retamal"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlLIxbUYL65dUq6N21AXrqYyFaejNc1P9qitEoad853wCdGw=s120-c-r