vice is very good; they let you look at the houses at your leisure and then answer your questions. I like that; I hate being constantly pressured by salespeople."",""published_at"":""2024-06-30T02:12:28.300659Z""},{""Name"":""Cindy Caroca"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUFEpRveBXjlnw4_TnyQ0S1G4VF_0kPGEFax23KcbCdZ3Afenv_Zg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Ya no están funcionando, no contestan los teléfonos y están siendo funados por Facebook por pedir pie para casas y después no realizarlas. Estafadores!!! Cuidado!!!"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURuaS1XZU53EAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114578012931437873116/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1728525121771518,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1728525121771518,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Ya no están funcionando, no contestan los teléfonos y están siendo funados por Facebook por pedir pie para casas y después no realizarlas. Estafadores!!! Cuidado!!!"",""text_translated"":""They're no longer operating, they don't answer the phones, and they're being publicly shamed on Facebook for asking for down payments on houses and then not building them. Scammers!!! Beware!!!"",""published_at"":""2024-10-10T01:52:01.771518Z""},{""Name"":""saxsy cornejo"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVQ16ExGxlBGFv-8NaLAtazMbkPprilQ_IRVn5zR6LPHUHSdFuA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Ese lugar ya esta cerrado"",""Images"":null,""When"":""6 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaRmJGWndhVXc1VGpoMk5qZGlUVWRxWkZaM2VFRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102871592625866319572/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1771433463615277,""updated_at_unix_micros"":17714