iginal"":""Mala experiencia.Mi señora compro y retiro hace dos semanas la casa en Pto.Varas,y ahora que está en proceso de armado los encargados se han ido dando cuenta que las medidas no corresponden con el plano final(ya se habían equivocado en el primero con las medidas)lo que nos ha hecho incurrir en gastos que no teníamos considerado y que a Casas Ohiggins poco le importará.Lamentable haber hecho negocio con ellos."",""text_translated"":""Bad experience. My wife bought and picked up the house in Puerto Varas two weeks ago, and now that it's being assembled, the workers have realized that the measurements don't match the final plans (they had already made a mistake with the measurements in the first one). This has caused us to incur unexpected expenses that Casas Ohiggins doesn't seem to care about. It's a shame we did business with them."",""published_at"":""2023-10-31T21:45:29.464665Z""},{""Name"":""jorge fuentes"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRSktEeXaQcxmX56S9gwCU5hHOl5bEGvJQX_OIV0w2AMJDb10=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Trabajan en todo lo referente a casas habitación está ubicada en caletera entrada norte de pto varas"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNncnNfWl9BRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102392189135903403234/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1739794369370507,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1739794369370507,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Trabajan en todo lo referente a casas habitación está ubicada en caletera entrada norte de pto varas"",""text_translated"":""They work on everything related to residential houses and are located on the north entrance service road of Puerto Varas."",""published_at"":""2025-02-17T12:12:49.370507Z""},{""Name"":""Carolina Perez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AL