quipo humano, siempre mantuvimos una buena comunicación y respondieron cada una de mis dudas 😊🤗👍🏻✌🏻"",""text_translated"":""I 100% recommend Casas Vichuquen Construction. They are very responsible, use high-quality materials, and have beautiful house designs. They have an excellent team; we always maintained good communication, and they answered all my questions. 😊🤗👍🏻✌🏻"",""published_at"":""2024-08-24T13:59:11.718091Z""},{""Name"":""Cristian Lizana"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLK4nNtSAUst-_P89AQTXrFyyqX5mtnUZcadJuLcDy5OXTj3sI=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Conocimos casas Vichuquén por sus publicaciones , los contacté y agende visita con el vendedor.  Javier nos mostró la exhibición y quedamos sorprendidos con el diseño y calidad de sus casas.\nSus materiales son de excelente calidad y la asesoría es personalizada."",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyNEphRmZ3EAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113853908073838872858/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1720840570293793,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1720840570293793,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Conocimos casas Vichuquén por sus publicaciones , los contacté y agende visita con el vendedor.  Javier nos mostró la exhibición y quedamos sorprendidos con el diseño y calidad de sus casas.\nSus materiales son de excelente calidad y la asesoría es personalizada."",""text_translated"":""We learned about Casas Vichuquén through their online listings, contacted them, and scheduled a visit with the salesperson. Javier showed us the showroom, and we were impressed by the design and quality of their homes.\nTheir materials are of excellent quality, and the service is personalized."",""published_at"":""2024-07-13T03:16:10.293793Z""},{""Name"":""Rafael Perez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWL1985DwiBXQNi1JkH6-E-WqY-cZf6Ot0WSivlpSJvUuwiMMbB=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""De principio a fin 100% confiables. La casa cumplio con todop lo ofrecido y cumplio con creces nuestras expectativas, diseño, materiales y servicio espectacular. Totalmente recomendables. Da gusto trabajar con gente muy responsable."",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNyNTVqZ3VRRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103757950907419339891/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1720736079514086,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1720736079514086,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""De principio a fin 100% confiables. La casa cumplio con todop lo ofrecido y cumplio con creces nuestras expectativas, diseño, materiales y servicio espectacular. Totalmente recomendables. Da gusto trabajar con gente muy responsable."",""text_translated"":""From start to finish, 100% reliable. The house met all the promises and exceeded our expectations; the design, materials, and service were spectacular. Highly recommended. It's a pleasure working with such responsible people."",""published_at"":""2024-07-11T22:14:39.514086Z""},{""Name"":""Rodrigo Marihuan"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI4xWs73NZzd5H4a_UgpK_bSAu4yebVKtG0W4QIPTu7cIQDbQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Proyecto de casa y su construcción, acorde con lo contratado, hubo asistencia y brindaron siempre una atención durante el proceso. Todo perfecto y 100% recomendada. Agradecido de la atención de Javier y Cristian Castro, siempre diligente."",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3aG9yZjFRRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113219388125690550236/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1724441827331718,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1724441827331718,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Proyecto de casa y su construcción, acorde con lo contratado, hubo asistencia y brindaron siempre una atención durante el proceso. Todo perfecto y 100% recomendada. Agradecido de la atención de Javier y Cristian Castro, siempre diligente."",""text_translated"":""The house project and its construction were exactly as agreed upon. They provided excellent support and attention throughout the entire process. Everything was perfect and I highly recommend them. I'm grateful for the attention and diligence of Javier and Cristian Castro."",""published_at"":""2024-08-23T19:37:07.331718Z""},{""Name"":""Maria Jose Aliaga Thompson"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMI_Y6oV2RkXTcDcrWkGZCXef-FaMteywbTcjBMzPrkYBctlQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Con mi esposo compramos acá nuestra casa para Rapel.nos brindaron siempre una muy buena atención, personalizada y cordial  tomamos la mejor decisión, la calidad es excelente  estamos  felices .  Recomiendo 100%"",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyZ09iNzdBRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104728890506462518685/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1720806852447028,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1720806852447028,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Con mi esposo compramos acá nuestra casa para Rapel.nos brindaron siempre una muy buena atención, personalizada y cordial  tomamos la mejor decisión, la calidad es excelente  estamos  felices .  Recomiendo 100%"",""text_translated"":""My husband and I bought our house here for Rapel. They always provided excellent, personalized, and friendly service. We made the best decision; the quality is excellent, and we are very happy. I recommend them 100%."",""