"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRcXY3eldREAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":2,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108842572443715007394/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1741018835478321,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1741018835478321,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""En la página sale horario continuado, (9:00 a 6:30) llegamos y estaba cerrado. No hay letrero que diga horario ni un acceso para preguntar solo un porton y los teléfonos que hay ahí anunciados que están  a la vista no contestan. Poca información... Pongan horarios reales en su página."",""text_translated"":""The website states continuous hours (9:00 to 6:30), but when we arrived, it was closed. There's no sign indicating the hours, no access point to inquire, just a gate, and the phone numbers posted there, which are clearly visible, are not answered. Very little information... Please post the actual hours on your website."",""published_at"":""2025-03-03T16:20:35.478321Z""},{""Name"":""Lisette Burrows Garcia"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIH9e_R2-V5uQ6fpVIiPZNXwI5rgihmXt667af9YREm50eY6Q=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Muy buena sus atenciones hasta los que traen nuestra casa .Para recomendarlos mucho."",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPSI4ycBR7GOmyp2VOSmEOyY-CNyxKC3XeKLmht1CpIg9FGuIwEtFS-p6JXpMUeDkKS4e3OsTkLY8vDbn5KLXcVpKX_FeNXUZEGQVYAyrY2LqKmrCT_sMEtgNcffCHqDZ37gZghTclCEs_2=k-no""],""When"":""11 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tka1pXSjRSM0JMU1ZGb0xUZG9NMmxPZW01d1JYYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113518164246858913101/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1759518448843571,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1759518448843571,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":"