els-pa.googleapis.com/v1/thumbnail?panoid=Vu9egMKucrB7enkX72AqhA\u0026cb_client=maps_sv.tactile.gps\u0026w=224\u0026h=298\u0026yaw=153.35667\u0026pitch=0\u0026thumbfov=100""}]",null,null,"{""link"":"""",""source"":""""}","{""id"":""114334926795906251998"",""name"":""Casas prefabricadas Chillán (Owner)"",""link"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114334926795906251998""}","{""borough"":"""",""street"":""Av. O'Higgins 3285"",""city"":""Chillán Viejo"",""postal_code"":""3820000"",""state"":""Ñuble"",""country"":""CL""}",,null,"[{""Name"":""Jaime Toro Somoza"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWhRDtdM-jt1E-UuFFvW4DrEcmlq8Ahmy5EMzJ_Qf9BWyFy0RV6=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":2,""Description"":""Compramos una casa con prefabricada con servicio de instalación en la ciudad de Chillan\nDe casa tiene muy poco, para bodega Perfecto\nLos maestro muy buenos, pero no están capacitados por la empresa, no tienen claro sobre los modelos y como se deben construir\nLa madera no esta bien impermeabilizada, al estar al sol corre la savia (resina)\nLas ventanas que venden pésimas, no cuadran vienen todas chuecas torcidas, las instalamos sin poder volver abrir las ventanas\nAun estamos a la espera de una respuesta, (desde marzo 24)"",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMFAOEranrjYjFRAnYregQAkE7DaMXQ4HTTqqptx9W7ZWKoPt87fBI_KbtOQ5aKXpTMcgnpj7daeIzXtd3DCR0IXbVXCokF6XoHvKx1pE6LVfihK9cRrfX2wWQeka1RvNEM0WF0=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMyGX0mhDLlRqyY8Ec5jr1YD-eDa8IEiZmaORZNRl_-BXHnm69VHD8Ts1W5V2OA3TPRoThjxhrGViBw7uBo4WU_psXt5uA2mcmQpoZuwaudU-v7fixtYDLM8m272jJKRVBrw-wG-A=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMHDPh-EHnW2o1qnohuAW-MoK1DwOxS9UHdA2Xq6yBM27hWYzdUDeWSRhwLRN6JBaEqwU1vMzWiU38XdmH_pizqqUZmKHs4Gqq0K4vrx8KCg8j7jIfznj_MbutG_F7oIrXs9NWn=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmOp6NV3oLTDqpgBmnBUpHb37GpO3vqBvWCW52pkAoffC5rbo-7R0dGEz7Wtn1tXBOqbgqk2PUgCJ3HnUti-_V4XqZKoLtmqP6XHuLp7WLkX3igvyqsiS3FUHToPYexwEOwuTtp2=k-no"",""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNzUKNLeuM3s_VYPjA_yFTRHAkV3U3gubdxu1A52pyo8zH9oOC85IWYsjnRjhcRv-UwbAE_61s1d7ujBC7v3NSUsAiv3mZiGRHclDAVEQVMUKWHpJtLSvlLZ6l5yaE7VYCCCj8U=k-no""],""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyNDhMMTlRRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":2,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100050332628212593206/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1721419430960201,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1721419430960201,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Compramos una casa con prefabricada con servicio de instalación en la ciudad de Chillan\nDe casa tiene muy poco, para bodega Perfecto\nLos maestro muy buenos, pero no están capacitados por la empresa, no tienen claro sobre los modelos y como se deben construir\nLa madera no esta bien impermeabilizada, al estar al sol corre la savia (resina)\nLas ventanas que venden pésimas, no cuadran vienen todas chuecas torcidas, las instalamos sin poder volver abrir las ventanas\nAun estamos a la espera de una respuesta, (desde marzo 24)"",""text_translated"":""We bought a prefabricated house with installation service in the city of Chillán. It's hardly a house; it's more like a storage shed. The installers are very good, but they aren't trained by the company and don't clearly understand the models or how they should be built. The wood isn't properly waterproofed; when exposed to the sun, the sap (resin) runs. The windows they sell are terrible; they don't fit properly and are all crooked and warped. We installed them, but we can't open the windows again. We're still waiting for a response (since March 24)."",""published_at"":""2024-07-19T20:03:50.960201Z""},{""Name"":""Iván Salgado"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXatVbFQxtKF3U6Pz5GSPd_1I0X1iFgDmYo77AR-Tq1hb0PgXyrYg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Me entregaron la casa en la fecha prevista (10 días hábiles) casa de 48m2, recomiendo"",""Images"":[""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPmjF0HJ_gb27Xp_nE5ldgrj2pvi63f3beGwPG11jSOs5I4szO-d1Ll8wLpLOTq_uPqsTF856g4pZ48Z2CbHF2MUA7PSlVEqLNrYDe6gSlbN86-2ZTXKGn3kA4ltlR64sQHSF0S=k-no""],""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURhd01xZDNBRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109455432975349579936/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1628775671970376,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1628775671970376,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Me entregaron la casa en la fecha prevista (10 días hábiles) casa de 48m2, recomiendo"",""text_translated"":""The house was delivered to me on the scheduled date (10 business days). It's a 48m2 house, I recommend it."",""reply_text"":""Thank you so much for your recommendation 👌😊"",""reply_text_original"":""Muchas gracias por su recomendación 👌😊"",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1631553992000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1631553992000000,""published_at"":""2021-08-12T13:41:11.970376Z""},{""Name"":""Gustavo Montenegro"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVAvWXrC07stpouFzA-y5leIGc_gMvrPpw6O9H-r2z3gFBhIwcm=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Fui a mediados de noviembre a hacer unas preguntas y fuimos atendidos mi familia y yo por Katherine, ejecutiva de Casas P. Chillan, vimos los modelos de casas y nos quedamos por la de 108 m2, consultamos por el flete y el armado y ya tenemos listo todo para comprar cuando llegue el momento....si se fijan son una empresa seria, no tienen reclamos, al parecer  porque se hacen cargo de sus ventas que se transforman en compromiso. Nos vemos pronto y gracias nuevamente por el tiempo y la atención."",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCMzRiQlR3EAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106565012078506022959/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1675262518632020,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1675262518632020,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Fui a mediados de noviembre a hacer unas preguntas y fuimos atendidos mi familia y yo por Katherine, ejecutiva de Casas P. Chillan, vimos los modelos de casas y nos quedamos por la de 108 m2, consultamos por el flete y el armado y ya tenemos listo todo para comprar cuando llegue el momento....si se fijan son una empresa seria, no tienen reclamos, al parecer  porque se hacen cargo de sus ventas que se transforman en compromiso. Nos vemos pronto y gracias nuevamente por el tiempo y la atención."",""text_translated"":""I went in mid-November to ask some questions, and my family and I were assisted by Katherine, an executive at Casas P. Chillan. We looked at the house models and chose the 108 m² one. We inquired about delivery and assembly, and we have everything ready to buy when the time comes. As you can see, they are a reputable company; they have no complaints, apparently because they take responsibility for their sales, which become a commitment. See you soon, and thanks again for your time and attention."",""published_at"":""2023-02-01T14:41:58.63202Z""},{""Name"":""Ariel Hidalgo"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdHA0wgz9ky3FCU5mgRGZKAygjSoIawi7YqDZBR4iOSSGQFag=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Arrepentido de haber comprado aca, el servicio es malo. Aparte nunca quieren perder. Se comprometen e ilucionan y al final no Cumplen."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR5djl5c0xnEAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118224031154055413836/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1616497134636905,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1616497312662794,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Arrepentido de haber comprado aca, el servicio es malo. Aparte nunca quieren perder. Se comprometen e ilucionan y al final no Cumplen."",""text_translated"":""I regret buying from here; the service is terrible. Besides, they never want to lose. They make promises and raise expectations, but in the end, they don't deliver."",""reply_text"":""Hello, good afternoon. We don't have a record of you as a customer, but we would like to help. You can contact our company Monday through Friday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM and Saturday until 2:00 PM. We apologize for the inconvenience, but we work every day to provide our customers with better service and support."",""reply_text_original"":""Hola, buenas tardes, no tenemos registro suyo como Cliente, pero si nos gustaría ayudar. Podría comunicarse con nuestra empresa de Lunes a Viernes de 9 a 18 hrs y sábado hasta 14 hrs. Lamentamos los percances sufridos pero trabajabamos cada día para entregarle a nuestros clientes una mejor atención y servició."",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1618092953000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1618092953000000,""published_at"":""2021-03-23T10:58:54.636905Z""},{""Name"":""Maria Maturana"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIMnPe3jStUqDC5rndbZ-D-Nnh_Jp3VgOZ_pE0XVItWpqS5SA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Compre una casa, cumplieron al 100 con la fecha de entrega super responsables y excelente calidad y servicio 100% recomendables.."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLMmE2d21BRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110071861415540472549/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1618117215270707,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1618117215270707,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Compre una casa, cumplieron al 100 con la fecha de entrega super responsables y excelente calidad y servicio 100% recomendables.."",""text_translated"":""I bought a house, they met the delivery date 100%, super responsible and excellent quality and service, 100% recommended."",""published_at"":""2021-04-11T05:00:15.270707Z""},{""Name"":""Jose Luis Alvarez Jamett"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2TVu0o9r8tEJATattzsPIR_mvlRaQQiKmlryl6_ToAh1FoGTK=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Buena atención.. esperamos comprar aquí.. en precios ... Los más baratos que he cotizado."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2ejhYbGJ3EAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114012322067853582626/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1631766473959033,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1631766473959033,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Buena atención.. esperamos comprar aquí.. en precios ... Los más baratos que he cotizado."",""text_translated"":""Great service... we hope to buy here... the prices are the cheapest I've seen."",""published_at"":""2021-09-16T04:27:53.959033Z""},{""Name"":""Barbara Nuñez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJOayFVhK1Sv2svNd37qieWeMMFTVK62jTR9E5krPeZVTLllA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Arrepentidos de haber comprado acá\nComenzamos con la atención deficiente de una vendedora no capacitada para después echarle toda la culpa\nNo recomiendo comprar acá compramos el kit completo con instalación y nos encontramos con muchas deficiencias no son nada serios\n\nUna vergüenza de empresa, sin respuestas"",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLbWE3SUJ3EAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102497881309292428392/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1618088287406434,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1618088287406434,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Arrepentidos de haber comprado acá\nComenzamos con la atención deficiente de una vendedora no capacitada para después echarle toda la culpa\nNo recomiendo comprar acá compramos el kit completo con instalación y nos encontramos con muchas deficiencias no son nada serios\n\nUna vergüenza de empresa, sin respuestas"",""text_translated"":""Regret buying here\nIt started with poor service from an untrained salesperson, who then blamed everything on her. I don't recommend buying here. We bought the complete kit with installation and found many problems. They're not serious at all.\n\nA disgrace of a company, no answers."",""reply_text"":""Hello, good evening. I'd like to inform you that your partner, who is the seller, has always received a timely response from our company, even exceeding the requirements of our sales contract.\n\nWe regret any misunderstandings that may have occurred, but we work every day to provide our customers with the best possible service and attention."",""reply_text_original"":""Hola, buenas noches, le comento que su pareja, el cual es el titular de la venta, ha recibido siempre una respuesta oportuna por parte de nuestra empresa, incluso cumpliendo más allá de lo que nuestro contrato de compraventa nos obliga.\nLamentamos los malos entendidos que pudiera haber sufrido, pero trabajabamos cada día para entregarle a nuestros clientes una mejor atención y servició."",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1618092915000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1618101201000000,""published_at"":""2021-04-10T20:58:07.406434Z""},{""Name"":""Daniela Amigo"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1JPvS8MwvhQKnGgMdNBmvBTAvdM7-EoRtPGrGZ7m10Xe8-QthFQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Atentos y dispuestos a responder las mil preguntas que tenía. Aún no me entregan la casa así que pronto comparto fotos y les cuento que tal todo."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM2cHNQNkl3EAE"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101468052026679875355/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1630704961849568,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1630704961849568,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Atentos y dispuestos a responder las mil preguntas que tenía. Aún no me entregan la casa así que pronto comparto fotos y les cuento que tal todo."",""text_translated"":""They were attentive and ready to answer all my questions. I haven't moved into the house yet, so I'll share photos and tell you all about it soon."",""reply_text"":""Thank you so much for your feedback 😊 We hope to see you soon at our company"",""reply_text_original"":""Muchas gracias por su opinión 😊 esperamos verla pronto por nuestra empresa"",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1631553924000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1631553924000000,""published_at"":""2021-09-03T21:36:01.849568Z""}]",null,
