te like this, since it's an opportunity to own your own home and they make everything more difficult. I don't recommend them at all."",""published_at"":""2025-01-30T11:27:58.775516Z""},{""Name"":""constanza henriquez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbRwr12bTdVODZo8WiClck4M9VvK7pdiRLn0yPkACUUtZvwOM=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Pésima experiencia, los materiales de baja calidad, los maestros iban a trabajar cuando querían, cero compromiso, la casa la entregaron descuadrada y la empresa no nos dio ninguna solución. Pésimo servicio."",""Images"":null,""When"":""2 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOdk5LRWl3RRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111068696244921349523/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1705097177898014,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1705097177898014,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Pésima experiencia, los materiales de baja calidad, los maestros iban a trabajar cuando querían, cero compromiso, la casa la entregaron descuadrada y la empresa no nos dio ninguna solución. Pésimo servicio."",""text_translated"":""Terrible experience. The materials were low quality, the workers showed up whenever they felt like it, zero commitment, the house was delivered out of square, and the company offered no solution. Awful service."",""published_at"":""2024-01-12T22:06:17.898014Z""},{""Name"":""Cesar Palavecino"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLIn209XOoyn60xo0r1Yt0tv19oDP75YTIZpO66W9wCUFEySg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""QUE NOS LES SUCEDA LO MISMO. NO ENTREGAN A FECHA ACORDADA. OFRECEN LO QUE NO ES. PÉSIMA ES LA POST VENTA. MUY MALA. TENGAN CUIDADO. SE LO DICE UN CLIENTE TOTALMENTE INSATISFECHO."",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpc3NpTDVnRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_s