"city"":""Linares"",""postal_code"":""3580000"",""state"":""Maule"",""country"":""CL""}",,"[{""id"":""service_options"",""name"":""Service options"",""options"":[{""name"":""On-site services"",""enabled"":true}]},{""id"":""parking"",""name"":""Parking"",""options"":[{""name"":""Free parking lot"",""enabled"":true}]}]","[{""Name"":""JAIME JIMENEZ DURAN"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIhqSE_A2RxsJTYNxgYu3BV9AoFcuUP3tqvz0vWgno2gwVI0Q=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Mala atención poca seriedad para responde por los detalles de deoro más de lo pactadoo Ben el contrato me tuve que. Volver a santias y viendo con abogados para tomar. Una decisión al respecto  e gastado mucho dinero con todos los malos ratos pasados"",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25rd2NHZFVOWFZKYTBSb1JXVkxlbUZQYWtaTk0wRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109739896075064249431/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1781726291421562,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1781726291421562,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Mala atención poca seriedad para responde por los detalles de deoro más de lo pactadoo Ben el contrato me tuve que. Volver a santias y viendo con abogados para tomar. Una decisión al respecto  e gastado mucho dinero con todos los malos ratos pasados"",""text_translated"":""Poor service, lack of professionalism in responding to the details of the gold, more than agreed upon in the contract. I had to go back to Santiago and consult with lawyers to make a decision about it. I've spent a lot of money with all the bad experiences I've had."",""reply_text"":""Dear Jaime,\n\nWe deeply regret your perception of our work, as it does not reflect the effort, dedication, and goodwill that Casas Valera Ortiz put into your project from day one.\n\nWe have photographic and video records documenting the entire construction process, from the start of the project to the final delivery of a fully completed home. Furthermore, during the project's development, we made significant improvements that were not originally planned, always with the intention of delivering a better home.\n\nAmong these improvements, the initial 140 m² project was expanded by approximately 20 m² to provide more space to the master bedroom. Additionally, an extra bathroom was built at no additional cost, and a larger kitchen was constructed using higher-quality, more expensive materials than those originally considered.\n\nAll of these improvements were made voluntarily and with the desire to deliver a result superior to the contracted amount, especially considering the relationship of trust established through a mutual friend.\n\nWe respect your right to express your opinion, but we regret that the additional efforts made to benefit your project were neither considered nor valued. Our company has always operated with transparency, professionalism, and commitment to each client, and we have the necessary track record to support our work.\n\nWe wish you success and reiterate that our history and the satisfaction of hundreds of families attest to the reliability and quality of Casas Valera Ortiz.\n\nSincerely,\n\nCasas Valera Ortiz"",""reply_text_original"":""Estimado Jaime:\n\nLamentamos profundamente su percepción sobre nuestro trabajo, ya que no refleja el esfuerzo, dedicación y buena voluntad que Casas Valera Ortiz puso en su proyecto desde el primer día.\n\nContamos con registros fotográficos y videos que documentan todo el proceso constructivo, desde el inicio de la obra hasta la entrega final de una vivienda completamente terminada. Además, durante el desarrollo del proyecto realizamos mejoras significativas que no estaban contempladas originalmente, siempre con la intención de entregar una mejor vivienda.\n\nEntre estas mejoras, se amplió el proyecto inicial de 140 m² incorporando aproximadamente 20 m² adicionales para brindar mayor amplitud al dormitorio principal. Asimismo, se construyó un baño adicional sin costo extra y se ejecutó una cocina de mayores dimensiones, utilizando materiales de mejor calidad y valor que los originalmente considerados.\n\nTodas estas mejoras fueron realizadas de manera voluntaria y con el deseo de entregar un resultado superior al contratado, especialmente considerando la relación de confianza existente a través de un amigo en común.\n\nRespetamos su derecho a expresar su opinión, pero lamentamos que no se consideren ni valoren los esfuerzos adicionales realizados en beneficio de su proyecto. Nuestra empresa siempre ha trabajado con transparencia, profesionalismo y compromiso con cada cliente, y contamos con los antecedentes necesarios para respaldar nuestro trabajo.\n\nLe deseamos éxito y reiteramos que nuestra trayectoria y la satisfacción de cientos de familias respaldan la seriedad y calidad de Casas Valera Ortiz.\n\nAtentamente,\n\nCasas Valera Ortiz"",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1781757494000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1781757494000000,""published_at"":""2026-06-17T19:58:11.421562Z""},{""Name"":""Ghisleyne Arellano"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWI2YkOyzcq8Ds_8PPDyKQEDgm-Mq3f-rvJ9z_z0U1qrp0-BHu7=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""exelente trabajoo"",""Images"":null,""When"":""3 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kaVVqTjFUemRoWDIxaWVHeG1WVzUxVnkxNlNGRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115749159765074852593/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1781728692278849,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1781728692278849,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""exelente trabajoo"",""text_translated"":""Excellent work!"",""published_at"":""2026-06-17T20:38:12.278849Z""