nd a huge lie. It was inspected by an engineer, uneven, and poorly constructed. We had to dismantle everything. He's nowhere to be found, he doesn't answer calls, and he hasn't shown up to give explanations or return the money."",""reply_text"":""Good morning, The person you mentioned does not work for or provide services to our company.\nOur website and social media platforms are for businesses and professionals who advertise or offer their services through our portal for a fee. Eco House Commercial and Services is not responsible for the services provided by these providers, as stated in our Legal Notices (sections two, five, and six) on our website.\nWe regret your situation and will remove any posts from our platforms that may cause you discomfort or harm."",""reply_text_original"":""Buenos días,La Persona que Menciona no trabaja ,ni Presta Servicios para Nuestra Empresa.\nNuestro Sitio Web y Redes Sociales,son Plataforma para Empresas y Profesionales que Publicitan o Ofrecen sus Servicios  a Través de Nuestro Portal,por un Pago.Sociedad Comercial y Servicios Eco House no es Responsable de los Servicios Prestados por dichos Oferentes,Como se hace Mención en Nuestros Avisos Legales (incisos segundo,quinto y sexto),en Nuestro Sitio Web.\nLamentamos su Situación y Por Nuestra Parte, Eliminaremos las Publicaciones de Nuestras Plataformas que le puedan ocasionar algún malestar o Menoscabo."",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1643889114000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1643889114000000,""published_at"":""2022-02-02T15:09:40.242963Z""},{""Name"":""Adrian Casadiego"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMbY5DxY1gHW4SSveWz-pIOyIgErE0TWSf3JAqHZbKTLXu2i7e9w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":"""",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214UVdrOXBjWFJzU1VSdWQwUlRRa3MyUlV0T1dYYxAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""