to,ya que se aprovechan de la gente y de sus ahorros ymas encima no entregan las casas,solo reciben el dinero y les dan falsas esperanzas,empiecen por cumplir con la palabra empeñada,asi lograran mucho mas"",""Images"":null,""When"":""6 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURzcXFlVm13RRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116654926436359545773/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1583020370592026,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1583020370592026,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""No me gusto,ya que se aprovechan de la gente y de sus ahorros ymas encima no entregan las casas,solo reciben el dinero y les dan falsas esperanzas,empiecen por cumplir con la palabra empeñada,asi lograran mucho mas"",""text_translated"":""I didn't like it, because they take advantage of people and their savings, and on top of that, they don't deliver the houses. They just take the money and give them false hope. They should start by keeping their word; that way they'll achieve much more."",""published_at"":""2020-02-29T23:52:50.592026Z""},{""Name"":""Priscilla Silva Guzmán"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxwpxlSMSMatHLDUdLVeGQTXdSRkYimsRQtzgKEXqcaqO2MFnGiA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Reviso la página web y aparece una página de ortopedia, nada que ver con el tema de casas prefabricadas"",""Images"":null,""When"":""a year ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGd05XRTNNMmsyWDBwYWFHWmlPSEpyYkVodVVsRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118232174209385831277/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1752939947771850,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1752939947771850,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Reviso la página web y aparece una página de ortopedia, nada que ver con el tema de casas p