49638868564""}","{""borough"":"""",""street"":""Camino Freire, Barros Arana, Km 2"",""city"":""Freire"",""postal_code"":"""",""state"":""Araucania"",""country"":""CL""}",,"[{""id"":""from_the_business"",""name"":""From the business"",""options"":[{""name"":""Identifies as women-owned"",""enabled"":true}]},{""id"":""service_options"",""name"":""Service options"",""options"":[{""name"":""Online estimates"",""enabled"":true},{""name"":""On-site services"",""enabled"":true}]}]","[{""Name"":""Hector Salazar"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ07O6TwAE2bjrc5Y2yjC2oHCqd-Kbnj413i98Au6-hf9xPGQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"",""Rating"":5,""Description"":""Exelente atención del personal"",""Images"":null,""When"":""4 months ago"",""review_id"":""Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twZmFWRkdlV1JYT0RWSWVucHZlRzVCUlVwcWNrRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":5,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106338846415334791375/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1778259460451588,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1778259460451588,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Exelente atención del personal"",""text_translated"":""Excellent service from the staff"",""published_at"":""2026-05-08T16:57:40.451588Z""},{""Name"":""Carlos Rioseco"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWas_fP5hoM3GfyRWHocQ1RO4MhC0ezy2hjm_qy36C3jYkORw4uag=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100"",""Rating"":1,""Description"":""Casas de buena calidad, pero precios un tanto elevados. no incluye radier. Faltan modelos in situ de casas. Poca claridad en la información. Falta muchísima publicidad. Pero lo principal poder ver las casas armadas y no tan solo en papel... La verdad no me gustó lo que ofrecen"",""Images"":null,""When"":""5 years ago"",""review_id"":""ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURpck9UdTdnRRAB"",""source"":""Google"",""rating_scale"":5,""rating_float"":1,""author_url"":""https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108145656332028278534/reviews?hl=en-GB"",""posted_at_unix_micros"":1606493731634758,""updated_at_unix_micros"":1606493732274398,""language"":""es"",""translated_lang"":""en"",""text_original"":""Casas de buena calidad, pero precios un tanto elevados. no incluye radier. Faltan modelos in situ de casas. Poca claridad en la información. Falta muchísima publicidad. Pero lo principal poder ver las casas armadas y no tan solo en papel... La verdad no me gustó lo que ofrecen"",""text_translated"":""The houses are of good quality, but the prices are somewhat high. The foundation slab is not included. There's a lack of on-site model homes. The information is unclear. There's a serious lack of advertising. But the most important thing is being able to see the houses built, not just on paper... Honestly, I didn't like what they offered."",""reply_text"":""Dear Carlos, Casas Andes specializes in selling prefabricated homes and provides plans for self-construction.\n\nYou can view our prefabricated homes on Facebook or Instagram. The images are for reference only and include photos provided by our clients. Our expertise lies in wood and structural elements.\nWe have two model homes available. As you can see, we've made progress. Constructive criticism is always welcome. Thank you."",""reply_text_original"":""Estimado Carlos, Casas Andes se dedica a la venta de prefabricados y entrega planos para autoconstruir.\nPuede ver nuestros prefabricados en facebook o Instagram.\nTiene imágenes referenciales y fotografías cedidas por nuestros clientes. Nuestro fuerte es la madera, estructuras.\nDisponemos de dos modelos pilotos. Como ve hemos avanzado. La crítica siempre es constructiva. Gracias."",""reply_language"":""es"",""reply_translated_lang"":""en"",""reply_posted_at_unix_micros"":1630444663000000,""reply_updated_at_unix_micros"":1630444663000000,""published_at"":""2020-11-27T16:15:31.634758Z""},{""Name"":""Christian Gutiérrez"",""ProfilePicture"":""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDR8ZWlvo86CLF